#: flowing.hooks:135 of
msgid ""
"唯一可决策的错误钩子：handler 在内部执行退避等待（sleep） / 换模型 / ``abort_turn()`` 等动作并写 "
"``ctx.can_continue`` （为 ``True`` 则 同一回合内重试）；观察 / 换模型 / 压缩后重试等处置均属 handler"
" 内部逻辑"
msgstr ""
"The only error hook with decision power: the handler internally performs actions such as backoff waiting "
"(sleep), switching models, and ``abort_turn()``, and writes ``ctx.can_continue`` (if ``True``, retry within "
"the same turn); dispositions such as observing, switching models, and retrying after compaction are all internal handler logic."

