#: flowing.hooks:180 of
msgid ""
"扩展声明集（不在预填集内；未启用对应扩展的实例访问这些钩子点抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.UnknownHookPointError`）："
msgstr ""
"Extension-declared set (not in the pre-filled set; accessing these hook points on an instance without the "
"corresponding extension installed raises :class:`flowing.errors.UnknownHookPointError`):"

#: flowing.hooks:183 of
msgid ""
"``before_skill_load`` / ``after_skill_load``：Skill 扩展声明， "
"``by=\"skill\"``，``match_on=\"name\"`` （见 :mod:`flowing.plugins.skills`）。"
msgstr ""
"``before_skill_load`` / ``after_skill_load``: declared by the Skill extension, "
"``by=\"skill\"``, ``match_on=\"name\"`` (see :mod:`flowing.plugins.skills`)."

#: flowing.hooks:185 of
msgid ""
"``on_signal``：Comm 扩展声明，``by=\"comm\"``，``match_on=\"type\"`` （见 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.comm`）。"
msgstr ""
"``on_signal``: declared by the Comm extension, ``by=\"comm\"``, ``match_on=\"type\"`` (see "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.comm`)."

#: flowing.hooks:187 of
msgid "``on_event``：Comm 扩展声明，``by=\"comm\"``，``match_on=\"topic\"``。"
msgstr "``on_event``: declared by the Comm extension, ``by=\"comm\"``, ``match_on=\"topic\"``."

#: flowing.hooks:188 of
msgid ""
"``on_cron_trigger``：Cron 扩展声明，``by=\"cron\"``，``match_on=\"source\"`` （见 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron`）。"
msgstr ""
"``on_cron_trigger``: declared by the Cron extension, ``by=\"cron\"``, ``match_on=\"source\"`` (see "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron`)."

#: flowing.hooks:190 of
msgid ""
"``on_compact``：Compact Composable 声明，``by=\"compact\"`` （见 "
":mod:`flowing.composables.compact`）。"
msgstr ""
"``on_compact``: declared by the Compact composable, ``by=\"compact\"`` (see "
":mod:`flowing.composables.compact`)."

#: flowing.hooks:192 of
msgid ""
"``on_retry``：Retry Composable 声明，``by=\"retry\"`` （见 "
":mod:`flowing.composables.retry`）。"
msgstr ""
"``on_retry``: declared by the Retry composable, ``by=\"retry\"`` (see "
":mod:`flowing.composables.retry`)."

#: flowing.hooks:197 of
msgid ""
"手写 Agent 子类在 ``setup()`` 中注册 handler，或经 :func:`on` 装饰器在类体 中声明（``@on`` "
"注册发生在 ``__init__`` 阶段、早于 ``setup()``，是注册 创建期钩子的唯一方式）："
msgstr ""
"Hand-written Agent subclasses register handlers in ``setup()``, or declare them in the class body via the "
":func:`on` decorator (``@on`` registration happens during ``__init__``, earlier than ``setup()``, and is the only way to register creation-phase hooks):"

#: flowing.hooks:231 of
msgid ""
"``.fya`` 声明式入口等价写法（``$script`` 中的 ``@on`` 在实例 ``__init__`` 阶段注册，早于 "
"``setup()``）："
msgstr ""
"Equivalent ``.fya`` declarative entry (``@on`` in ``$script`` registers during the instance "
"``__init__`` phase, earlier than ``setup()``):"

#: flowing.hooks:247 of
msgid "handler 统一签名与三种合法出口："
msgstr "Unified handler signature and three legal exits:"

#: flowing.hooks:249 of
msgid ""
"所有钩子 handler 签名统一为 ``(agent, value) -> value``：``agent`` 是钩子 宿主对象（Agent "
"专属钩子点上是当前 Agent 实例；Workflow 自带钩子点上是 ``Workflow`` 实例），``value`` "
"的类型由钩子点决定（见上方全集表）。无 value 的钩子点（如 ``after_create``）handler 只收 ``agent`` "
"一个参数。"
msgstr ""
"All hook handlers share the unified signature ``(agent, value) -> value``: ``agent`` is the hook host object "
"(the current ``Agent`` instance on Agent-specific hook points; the ``Workflow`` instance on Workflow's own "
"hook points); the type of ``value`` is determined by the hook point (see the full table above). Hook points without a value (e.g. ``after_create``) take only the ``agent`` parameter."

#: flowing.hooks:253 of
msgid "出口一：``return value`` （改写后或原样）——结果传给下一个 handler，最终 返回给 dispatch 的调用方。"
msgstr "Exit one: ``return value`` (rewritten or as-is) — the result is passed to the next handler and finally returned to the dispatch caller."

#: flowing.hooks:255 of
msgid ""
"出口二：在 value 上设置 ``shortcut`` 字段后返回——分发链停止，调用方跳过 默认逻辑（如缓存命中时直接采用 handler "
"提供的工具结果）；对应操作的 ``after_`` 钩子照常触发。"
msgstr ""
"Exit two: return after setting the ``shortcut`` field on value — the dispatch chain stops and the caller skips the "
"default logic (e.g. directly adopting the handler-provided tool result on a cache hit); the corresponding operation's ``after_`` hook fires as usual."

#: flowing.hooks:258 of
msgid ""
"出口三：``raise Intercepted``——硬阻断信号，分发链停止、整个操作标记为 无效、对应操作的 ``after_`` "
"钩子不触发。:class:`flowing.errors.Intercepted` 刻意不是 ``FlowingError`` "
"的子类，捕获框架错误时不会误捕它。"
msgstr ""
"Exit three: ``raise Intercepted`` — a hard-blocking signal: the dispatch chain stops, the whole operation is marked "
"invalid, and the corresponding operation's ``after_`` hook does not fire. :class:`flowing.errors.Intercepted` is "
"deliberately not a subclass of ``FlowingError``, so it is not accidentally caught when catching framework errors."

#: flowing.hooks:261 of
msgid ""
"携带 value 的钩子点要求每个 handler 返回值：返回 ``None`` 视为编程错误， 抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.FlowingError` （消息含钩子点名与 handler 标识）。 无 value "
"的钩子点不施加该检查。"
msgstr ""
"Hook points carrying a value require every handler to return a value: returning ``None`` is treated as a programming "
"error and raises :class:`flowing.errors.FlowingError` (the message contains the hook point name and the handler identifier). "
"Hook points without a value are not subject to this check."

#: flowing.hooks:264 of
msgid ""
"同步与异步 handler 透明混用：分发器检测到 awaitable 结果就 ``await``。 全部钩子点（含创建 / 销毁 / "
"恢复管线）均接受同步或异步 handler；注册时 不校验 handler 签名，签名错误在分发时按普通异常上抛。"
msgstr ""
"Sync and async handlers mix transparently: the dispatcher ``await``s awaitable results. All hook points (including the "
"create / destroy / recover pipelines) accept sync or async handlers; handler signatures are not validated at registration — signature errors are raised as ordinary exceptions at dispatch time."

#: flowing.hooks:268 of
msgid "dispatch 统一算法（:meth:`HookList.dispatch` 是全局唯一的钩子分发实现）："
msgstr "Unified dispatch algorithm (:meth:`HookList.dispatch` is the globally unique hook dispatch implementation):"

#: flowing.hooks:270 of
msgid ""
"按注册顺序遍历活跃条目（``enabled=False`` 的条目跳过），每个条目先按 其 ``pattern`` 过滤（用 "
"``fnmatch`` 匹配 value 的 ``match_on`` 字段）， 不匹配则跳过、value 原样透传给后续 handler。"
msgstr ""
"Iterate active entries in registration order (entries with ``enabled=False`` are skipped); each entry is first filtered by "
"its ``pattern`` (``fnmatch`` against the value's ``match_on`` field); non-matching entries are skipped and the value passes through unchanged to subsequent handlers."

#: flowing.hooks:273 of
msgid ""
"普通异常直接上抛：不捕获、不通知、不继续后续 handler、无任何兜底钩子。 ``Intercepted`` 被捕获后立即重抛（链停止、后续 "
"handler 不执行），只记 INFO 级日志。"
msgstr ""
"Ordinary exceptions propagate directly: not caught, not notified, subsequent handlers not continued, no fallback hook of any kind. "
"``Intercepted`` is re-raised immediately after being caught (the chain stops and subsequent handlers do not run), with only an INFO-level log."

#: flowing.hooks:276 of
msgid "没有活跃 handler（或全部被过滤）时原样返回传入的 value。"
msgstr "When there are no active handlers (or all are filtered out), the incoming value is returned as-is."

#: flowing.hooks:278 of
msgid "两类钩子语义："
msgstr "Two kinds of hook semantics:"

#: flowing.hooks:280 of
msgid "``before_`` / ``after_`` 钩子点：Agent 自身控制流（主动操作）前后的拦截、 加工与通知点。"
msgstr "``before_`` / ``after_`` hook points: interception, processing, and notification points before and after the Agent's own control flow (active operations)."

#: flowing.hooks:282 of
msgid ""
"``on_`` 钩子点：外部触发（被动响应）。命名只描述触发方向，不承诺 handler 能力——各 ``on_`` "
"钩子点独立定义（``on_provider_error`` 可决策、 ``on_signal`` 可改 "
"payload、``on_provider_delta`` 纯观察）。不要假设 ``on_`` handler 都只能观察。"
msgstr ""
"``on_`` hook points: external triggers (passive responses). The naming only describes the trigger direction and does not promise handler capabilities — "
"each ``on_`` hook point is defined independently (``on_provider_error`` can decide, ``on_signal`` can rewrite the "
"payload, ``on_provider_delta`` is pure observation). Do not assume ``on_`` handlers can only observe."

#: flowing.hooks:287 of
msgid "watcher 通道（``watch``，与钩子点并列的扩展契约）："
msgstr "Watcher channel (``watch``, an extension contract parallel to hook points):"

#: flowing.hooks:289 of
msgid ""
"``self.hooks.watch(name, handler)`` 注册 ``(agent, value)`` 形态的 "
"watcher；``Agent.watch`` 是 ``(new, old)`` 回调糖。``name`` 按 ``fnmatch`` "
"pattern 匹配 value（:class:`flowing.agent.FieldUpdate`， 含 ``name`` / ``new``"
" / ``old`` 字段）的 ``name`` 属性，字面量即精确匹配。"
msgstr ""
"``self.hooks.watch(name, handler)`` registers a watcher of the form ``(agent, value)``; ``Agent.watch`` is "
"``(new, old)`` callback sugar. ``name`` is matched as an ``fnmatch`` pattern against the ``name`` attribute of the value "
"(:class:`flowing.agent.FieldUpdate`, with ``name`` / ``new`` / ``old`` fields); a literal matches exactly."

#: flowing.hooks:293 of
msgid ""
"watcher 以 fire-and-forget 方式触发（``asyncio.ensure_future``，不 await）：赋值语句不等待"
" watcher 执行，watcher 的执行时序与赋值本身不 保证先后——这是 watcher 与普通钩子的根本区别（其余钩子点都在异步管线 "
"上被显式 await）。"
msgstr ""
"Watchers fire in a fire-and-forget manner (``asyncio.ensure_future``, not awaited): the assignment statement does not wait "
"for the watcher to run, and the execution order of the watcher relative to the assignment itself is not guaranteed — this is the "
"fundamental difference between watchers and ordinary hooks (all other hook points are explicitly awaited on the async pipeline)."

#: flowing.hooks:297 of
msgid ""
"watcher 是纯观察：修改 ``new`` 无效（赋值已经发生，watcher 的返回值被 忽略）；``raise Intercepted``"
" 与普通异常同处理——终止本次 watcher 链、 记录日志，不干扰赋值。"
msgstr ""
"Watchers are pure observation: modifying ``new`` has no effect (the assignment has already happened and the watcher's return value is "
"ignored); ``raise Intercepted`` is handled the same as an ordinary exception — it terminates this watcher chain and is logged, without disturbing the assignment."

#: flowing.hooks:300 of
msgid "无运行中 event loop 时 watcher 静默跳过（赋值照常）。"
msgstr "When there is no running event loop, watchers are silently skipped (the assignment proceeds normally)."

#: flowing.hooks:301 of
msgid ""
"顶层槽位的赋值只能观察、不能拦截（拦截请用 Python 原生的 property setter）；插件托管变量应以插件自有对象为载体（如 "
"``agent.i18n.locale = \"en\"`` 走该对象自己的 ``__setattr__``）。"
msgstr ""
"Assignment to top-level slots can only be observed, not intercepted (use Python's native property setter for interception); plugin-hosted variables should be carried "
"by the plugin's own object (e.g. ``agent.i18n.locale = \"en\"`` goes through that object's own ``__setattr__``)."

#: flowing.hooks:305 of
msgid "声明独占、注册开放、谁声明谁 dispatch："
msgstr "Exclusive declaration, open registration, whoever declares dispatches:"

#: flowing.hooks:307 of
msgid ""
"同名钩子点只允许一个声明者（冲突规则见 :meth:`HookRegistry.declare`）； ``by`` 必填——框架核心 "
"``by=\"core\"``，扩展用自身标识。"
msgstr ""
"Only one declarer is allowed per hook point name (see :meth:`HookRegistry.declare` for conflict rules); ``by`` is required — "
"the framework core uses ``by=\"core\"`` and extensions use their own identifier."

#: flowing.hooks:309 of
msgid "声明后任何代码都可以向该钩子点挂 handler，无需再声明：声明者是 “所有者”，注册者是“使用者”。"
msgstr "After declaration, any code may attach handlers to that hook point without further declaration: the declarer is the \"owner\", registrants are \"users\"."

#: flowing.hooks:311 of
msgid ""
"框架只在创建 / 恢复 / 销毁管线与 Turn 循环的固定位置 dispatch 核心钩子 点；扩展自行 dispatch "
"自己声明的钩子点，调用方式与框架内部一致 （``await hooks.<name>.dispatch(agent, value)``）。"
msgstr ""
"The framework dispatches core hook points only at fixed positions in the create / recover / destroy pipelines and the Turn loop; extensions "
"dispatch the hook points they declared themselves, in the same way as the framework internals (``await hooks.<name>.dispatch(agent, value)``)."

#: flowing.hooks:315 of
msgid "注册时机与外部观察者："
msgstr "Registration timing and external observers:"

#: flowing.hooks:317 of
msgid ""
"注册不限于 ``setup()``：分发在触发时现场读 handler 列表，运行中途挂上 即生效。REPL / HTTP 服务层 / "
"测试代码与插件走同一个公开注册入口，无 权限分级；外部 handler 与插件 handler 权力相同（挂在决策型钩子点上同样 可以改写 "
"value 或 ``raise Intercepted``，纯观察用途请挂 ``after_*`` / ``on_*`` 点并原样返回 "
"value）。"
msgstr ""
"Registration is not limited to ``setup()``: dispatch reads the handler list on the spot when triggered, so attaching midway takes effect immediately. The REPL / "
"HTTP service layer / test code / plugins all use the same public registration entry with no permission tiers; external handlers have the same power as plugin handlers "
"(attached to a decision-type hook point they may likewise rewrite the value or ``raise Intercepted``; for pure observation, attach to ``after_*`` / ``on_*`` points and return the value as-is)."

#: flowing.hooks:322 of
msgid ""
"带自己的 ``by=`` （如 ``by=\"web\"``）可获得整组管理能力 "
"（``remove_by_owner`` / 启停），不与插件 handler 混淆。"
msgstr ""
"Bringing your own ``by=`` (e.g. ``by=\"web\"``) gives you whole-group management capability "
"(``remove_by_owner`` / enable-disable), without being confused with plugin handlers."

#: flowing.hooks:324 of
msgid "钩子只能从进程内代码注册：框架没有经 HTTP 挂钩子的端点，需要远程推送 通道的服务层自行在进程内挂钩后转发。"
msgstr "Hooks can only be registered from in-process code: the framework has no HTTP endpoint for attaching hooks; service layers needing a remote push channel attach hooks in-process and forward themselves."

#: flowing.hooks:326 of
msgid ""
"错误不是事件：内部错误以异常上抛（无 ``on_error`` 兜底钩子），唯一可 决策的错误钩子是 "
"``on_provider_error``；观测后台错误的现成通道是 :mod:`flowing._unstable.logging` （落盘 "
"logging.jsonl）。"
msgstr ""
"Errors are not events: internal errors are raised as exceptions (no ``on_error`` fallback hook); the only error hook with decision power is "
"``on_provider_error``; the ready-made channel for observing background errors is :mod:`flowing._unstable.logging` (persists to logging.jsonl)."

#: flowing.hooks:330 of
msgid "``by=`` 惯例与整组管理："
msgstr "``by=`` convention and whole-group management:"

#: flowing.hooks:332 of
msgid ""
"``by`` 是整组管理的锚点：同一来源的 handler 共用同一个 ``by``，可以整组 "
"停用（``disable_by_owner``）或整组移除（``remove_by_owner``）。"
msgstr ""
"``by`` is the anchor of whole-group management: handlers from the same source share the same ``by`` and can be "
"disabled as a group (``disable_by_owner``) or removed as a group (``remove_by_owner``)."

#: flowing.hooks:334 of
msgid "注册顺序即执行顺序：同一钩子点上先注册的 handler 先执行；不做去重， 同一 handler 重复注册、每次触发都会执行多次。"
msgstr "Registration order is execution order: on the same hook point, handlers registered earlier run first; no deduplication — registering the same handler repeatedly executes it multiple times per trigger."

#: flowing.hooks:339 of
msgid ""
":class:`flowing.agent.Agent` （``hooks`` 属性、``watch`` 方法） "
":class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext` （turn 族钩子的 value 类型） "
":class:`flowing.errors.Intercepted` （handler 的硬阻断信号） "
":class:`flowing.errors.UnknownHookPointError` / "
":class:`flowing.errors.DuplicateHookPointError` （钩子点访问与声明错误） "
":class:`flowing.lists.ManagedList` （分组管理容器抽象） "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.skills` / :mod:`flowing.plugins.comm` / "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron` （扩展钩子点的声明方） :mod:`flowing.composables.retry` "
"/ :mod:`flowing.composables.compact` （Composable 钩子点声明方）"
msgstr ""
":class:`flowing.agent.Agent` (the ``hooks`` attribute, the ``watch`` method) "
":class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext` (the value type of the turn-family hooks) "
":class:`flowing.errors.Intercepted` (the handler's hard-blocking signal) "
":class:`flowing.errors.UnknownHookPointError` / "
":class:`flowing.errors.DuplicateHookPointError` (hook point access and declaration errors) "
":class:`flowing.lists.ManagedList` (the grouped-management container abstraction) "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.skills` / :mod:`flowing.plugins.comm` / "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.cron` (declarers of extension hook points) :mod:`flowing.composables.retry` "
"/ :mod:`flowing.composables.compact` (declarers of composable hook points)"

#: flowing.hooks.HookList:1 of
msgid "单个钩子点的容器。"
msgstr "Container for a single hook point."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList:5 of
msgid ""
"每个钩子点一个实例，由 :class:`HookRegistry` 持有。提供统一注册入口 （``hook(handler, by=..., "
"tags=...)``）、``__getitem__`` 三形态索引 与统一分发入口 :meth:`dispatch`；分组管理能力继承自 "
":class:`ManagedList`。"
msgstr ""
"One instance per hook point, held by :class:`HookRegistry`. Provides the unified registration entry "
"(``hook(handler, by=..., tags=...)``), the three-form ``__getitem__`` indexing, and the unified dispatch entry "
":meth:`dispatch`; whole-group management capability is inherited from :class:`ManagedList`."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList:10 of
msgid "注册顺序即执行顺序：同一钩子点上先注册的 handler 先执行。"
msgstr "Registration order is execution order: on the same hook point, handlers registered earlier run first."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList:25 of
msgid ""
"注册入口：``__call__(handler, *, by=None, tags=None) -> HookHandler``， 返回被注册的原"
" handler，追加到末尾（注册顺序即执行顺序）；``by`` 省略记为 ``None`` （与 "
":meth:`HookRegistry.declare` 的必填 ``by`` 是 两个层面）。"
msgstr ""
"Registration entry: ``__call__(handler, *, by=None, tags=None) -> HookHandler``, returns the registered original "
"handler, appended to the end (registration order is execution order); an omitted ``by`` is recorded as ``None`` (a different layer "
"from the required ``by`` of :meth:`HookRegistry.declare`)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList:29 of
msgid ""
"``__getitem__`` 三形态见下；``int`` / ``slice`` 基于含 disabled 的 "
"完整底层列表做位置索引（用于自省），与 ``__iter__`` / :meth:`dispatch` 的“跳过 disabled”语义互不干扰。"
msgstr ""
"``__getitem__`` has three forms, see below; ``int`` / ``slice`` do positional indexing on the full underlying list "
"including disabled entries (for introspection), which does not interfere with the \"skip disabled\" semantics of ``__iter__`` / :meth:`dispatch`."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList:32 of
msgid ""
"构造阶段钩子点（``before_create`` / ``after_create`` / ``before_destroy`` / "
"``after_destroy`` / ``before_recover`` / "
"``after_recover``）与运行期钩子点一样接受同步或异步 handler；注册时 不做同步性检查，分发统一处理 awaitable。"
msgstr ""
"Construction-phase hook points (``before_create`` / ``after_create`` / ``before_destroy`` / "
"``after_destroy`` / ``before_recover`` / "
"``after_recover``) accept sync or async handlers just like runtime hook points; no synchronicity check at registration — dispatch handles awaitables uniformly."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList:39 of
msgid ""
":class:`HookRegistry`、:class:`HookEntry`、:class:`PatternRegistrar`、 "
":class:`ManagedList`"
msgstr ""
":class:`HookRegistry`, :class:`HookEntry`, :class:`PatternRegistrar`, "
":class:`ManagedList`"

#: flowing.hooks.HookList.name:1 of
msgid "钩子点名（如 ``\"before_tool_call\"``），在所属 ``HookRegistry`` 内唯一。"
msgstr "Hook point name (e.g. ``\"before_tool_call\"``), unique within its owning ``HookRegistry``."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList.by:1 of
msgid ""
"钩子点的声明者标识（框架核心 ``\"core\"``，扩展用自身标识）；必填， 见 :meth:`HookRegistry.declare` "
"的声明独占规则。"
msgstr ""
"The hook point's declarer identifier (``\"core\"`` for the framework core; extensions use their own identifier); required, "
"see the declaration-exclusivity rule of :meth:`HookRegistry.declare`."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList.match_on:1 of
msgid ""
"pattern 过滤时读取 value 的属性名，默认 ``\"name\"``；通信扩展使用 ``\"type\"`` "
"（``on_signal``）/ ``\"topic\"`` （``on_event``）。"
msgstr ""
"The attribute name of the value read during pattern filtering, default ``\"name\"``; the comm extension uses ``\"type\"`` "
"(``on_signal``) / ``\"topic\"`` (``on_event``)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList.dispatch:1 of
msgid "统一分发算法：按注册顺序执行活跃 handler 的改写链。"
msgstr "Unified dispatch algorithm: execute the rewrite chain of active handlers in registration order."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList.dispatch:5 of
msgid ""
"全框架唯一的钩子分发实现。框架在创建 / 恢复 / 销毁管线与 Turn 循环 固定位置 dispatch 核心钩子点；扩展 dispatch "
"自己声明的钩子点时调用 的也是本方法（谁声明谁 dispatch）。"
msgstr ""
"The framework's only hook dispatch implementation. The framework dispatches core hook points at fixed positions in the create / recover / "
"destroy pipelines and the Turn loop; extensions also call this method when dispatching hook points they declared themselves (whoever declares dispatches)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList.dispatch:18 of
msgid ""
"迭代活跃条目（跳过 ``enabled=False``），逐条执行： ``entry.pattern`` 非空时先 "
"``fnmatch(getattr(value, self.match_on), entry.pattern)`` 过滤，不匹配则跳过（value"
" 原样透传）。"
msgstr ""
"Iterate active entries (skipping ``enabled=False``) and execute one by one: when ``entry.pattern`` is non-empty, filter first with "
"``fnmatch(getattr(value, self.match_on), entry.pattern)``; non-matching entries are skipped (value "
"passes through unchanged)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList.dispatch:21 of
msgid ""
"``result = entry.handler(agent, value)``；检测为 awaitable 则 ``await``——同步 / "
"异步 handler 透明混用。"
msgstr ""
"``result = entry.handler(agent, value)``; if the result is awaitable, ``await`` it — sync / "
"async handlers mix transparently."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList.dispatch:23 of
msgid ""
"首参 ``agent`` 是钩子宿主对象：Agent 专属钩子点上是 ``Agent`` 实例；Workflow 自己的 ``hooks`` "
"（``before_tool_call`` / ``after_tool_call``）上是 ``Workflow`` 实例。dispatch "
"自身只透传、 从不访问其属性；需要 Agent 能力的 handler 自行 ``isinstance`` 判断。"
msgstr ""
"The first argument ``agent`` is the hook host object: an ``Agent`` instance on Agent-specific hook points; a ``Workflow`` instance on "
"Workflow's own ``hooks`` (``before_tool_call`` / ``after_tool_call``). dispatch "
"itself only passes it through and never accesses its attributes; handlers needing Agent capabilities do their own ``isinstance`` check."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList.dispatch:28 of
msgid ""
"携带 value 的钩子点（``value`` 参数非 ``None`` 调入）要求每个 handler 返回值：handler 返回 "
"``None`` 视为编程错误，抛 :class:`flowing.errors.FlowingError` （消息含钩子点名与 handler "
"标识）。无 value 的钩子点（``after_create`` 等）不施加该检查。"
msgstr ""
"Hook points carrying a value (invoked with a non-``None`` ``value`` parameter) require every handler to return a value: a handler returning "
"``None`` is treated as a programming error and raises :class:`flowing.errors.FlowingError` (the message contains the hook point name and the handler "
"identifier). Hook points without a value (``after_create`` etc.) are not subject to this check."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList.dispatch:32 of
msgid ""
"``value = result`` 后检查 ``getattr(value, \"shortcut\", None)``： 非 ``None``"
" 立即停止链并返回该 value（协商短路；对应操作的 ``after_`` 钩子由调用方保证照常触发）。"
msgstr ""
"After ``value = result``, check ``getattr(value, \"shortcut\", None)``: if non-``None``, "
"stop the chain immediately and return that value (negotiated short-circuit; the caller guarantees the corresponding operation's ``after_`` hook still fires)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList.dispatch:35 of
msgid ""
":class:`flowing.errors.Intercepted`：捕获后立即重抛——链停止、 后续 handler "
"不执行、不当作错误（对应操作的 ``after_`` 钩子不 触发）。"
msgstr ""
":class:`flowing.errors.Intercepted`: re-raised immediately after being caught — the chain stops, subsequent "
"handlers do not run, and it is not treated as an error (the corresponding operation's ``after_`` hook does "
"not fire)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList.dispatch:38 of
msgid "普通异常直接上抛：不捕获、不通知、不继续后续 handler、无任何兜底 钩子。"
msgstr "Ordinary exceptions propagate directly: not caught, not notified, subsequent handlers not continued, no fallback hook of any kind."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList.dispatch:40 of
msgid "无 handler（或全部 disabled / 被 pattern 过滤）时原样返回 ``value``。"
msgstr "When there are no handlers (or all are disabled / filtered by pattern), ``value`` is returned as-is."

#: flowing.hooks.HookList.dispatch:45 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.errors.Intercepted`、 :meth:`ManagedList.__iter__`"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.errors.Intercepted`, :meth:`ManagedList.__iter__`"

#: flowing.hooks.HookEntry:1 of
msgid "单个 handler 条目：注册元信息 + 过滤条件 + 开关。"
msgstr "A single handler entry: registration metadata + filter condition + switch."

#: flowing.hooks.HookEntry:5 of
msgid ""
":class:`HookList` 的元素类型，满足 :class:`Togglable` 契约。由 "
":meth:`HookList.__call__` / :meth:`PatternRegistrar.__call__` 构造； "
"用户通常不直接实例化，而是通过注册与分组管理 API 间接持有。"
msgstr ""
"The element type of :class:`HookList`, satisfying the :class:`Togglable` contract. Constructed by "
":meth:`HookList.__call__` / :meth:`PatternRegistrar.__call__`; "
"users usually do not instantiate it directly, but hold it indirectly through the registration and group-management APIs."

#: flowing.hooks.HookEntry:9 of
msgid ""
"pattern 过滤条件与 handler 绑定为一条记录，使 disable / enable / remove 等分组操作对“带 "
"pattern 的 handler”同样生效。"
msgstr ""
"The pattern filter condition and the handler are bound into one record, so that group operations such as disable / enable / remove "
"also apply to \"pattern-carrying handlers\"."

#: flowing.hooks.HookEntry:14 of
msgid ""
"``pattern`` 非 ``None`` 时，分发先按 ``fnmatch(getattr(value, "
"hook_list.match_on), pattern)`` 过滤， 不匹配则跳过本条目（value 原样透传给后续 handler）。"
msgstr ""
"When ``pattern`` is non-``None``, dispatch first filters with ``fnmatch(getattr(value, "
"hook_list.match_on), pattern)``; non-matching entries are skipped (value passes through unchanged to subsequent handlers)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookEntry:17 of
msgid ""
"``enabled=False`` 的条目仍保留在容器中（注册顺序不变），但不出现在 迭代与分发中；之后调用 "
"``enable_by_owner`` / ``enable_by_tag`` 可恢复。"
msgstr ""
"Entries with ``enabled=False`` remain in the container (registration order unchanged) but do not appear in iteration or dispatch; "
"they can later be restored via ``enable_by_owner`` / ``enable_by_tag``."

#: flowing.hooks.HookEntry:23 of
msgid ":class:`HookList`、:class:`PatternRegistrar`、:class:`Togglable`"
msgstr ":class:`HookList`, :class:`PatternRegistrar`, :class:`Togglable`"

#: flowing.hooks.HookEntry.handler:1 of
msgid "钩子 handler，签名 ``(agent, value) -> value`` （同步或返回 awaitable）。"
msgstr "The hook handler, signature ``(agent, value) -> value`` (sync or returning an awaitable)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookEntry.by:1 of
msgid ""
"来源 / 所有者单一标识（如 ``\"retry\"``、``\"guardrail\"``）；注册时省略 则记为 "
"``None``。与钩子点声明的 ``by`` （必填）是两个层面的字段。"
msgstr ""
"Single identifier of the source / owner (e.g. ``\"retry\"``, ``\"guardrail\"``); recorded as ``None`` if omitted at registration. "
"This is a different layer from the hook point declaration's ``by`` (required)."

#: flowing.hooks.HookEntry.tags:1 of
msgid "任意标签列表，供批量分组管理。"
msgstr "Arbitrary tag list, for batch group management."

#: flowing.hooks.HookEntry.pattern:1 of
msgid "fnmatch 过滤模式；仅经 ``hook[\"pattern\"](handler)`` 注册时非 ``None``。"
msgstr "fnmatch filter pattern; non-``None`` only when registered via ``hook[\"pattern\"](handler)``."

#: flowing.hooks.HookEntry.enabled:1 of
msgid "启用标记；``ManagedList`` 的 disable/enable 直接翻转本字段。"
msgstr "Enable flag; ``ManagedList``'s disable/enable flip this field directly."

#: collections.abc.Callable:1 of
msgid ""
"handler 统一签名 ``(agent, value) -> value``；同步返回或返回 awaitable 均可， 分发器检测到 "
"awaitable 结果就 ``await`` （含构造阶段钩子点）。 此处用 ``Callable[..., Any]`` 承载是因为各钩子点 "
"value 类型不同； 精确契约见模块 docstring 的“核心钩子点全集”。"
msgstr ""
"Unified handler signature ``(agent, value) -> value``; returning synchronously or returning an awaitable both work — the dispatcher "
"``await``s awaitable results (including construction-phase hook points). ``Callable[..., Any]`` is used here because each hook point "
"has a different value type; the precise contract is in the module docstring's \"Complete Set of Core Hook Points\"."

#: flowing.lists.Togglable:1 of
msgid "``ManagedList`` 的元素契约：条目具备 ``enabled`` / ``by`` / ``tags`` 三个属性即可被容器管理。"
msgstr "``ManagedList``'s element contract: an entry can be managed by the container as long as it has the three attributes ``enabled`` / ``by`` / ``tags``."

#: flowing.lists.Togglable:5 of
msgid ""
":class:`ManagedList` 只感知条目的这三个属性，其余字段一概不关心。 "
"本协议是结构契约：条目类无需显式继承本协议，具备三个属性即满足； 协议未加 ``@runtime_checkable``，不要用 "
"``isinstance`` 检查条目 是否满足契约（会抛 ``TypeError``）。"
msgstr ""
":class:`ManagedList` only perceives these three attributes of an entry and does not care about any other fields. "
"This protocol is a structural contract: entry classes need not explicitly inherit this protocol — having the three attributes suffices; the protocol is not "
"``@runtime_checkable``, so do not use ``isinstance`` to check whether an entry satisfies the contract (it raises ``TypeError``)."

#: flowing.lists.Togglable:12 of
msgid "``enabled``：启用标记。容器对它的修改是原地赋值（停用置 ``False``、恢复置 ``True``），条目本身不移动。"
msgstr "``enabled``: enable flag. The container's modification of it is in-place assignment (set to ``False`` to disable, ``True`` to restore); the entry itself does not move."

#: flowing.lists.Togglable:14 of
msgid "``by``：来源或所有者标识。允许 ``None``；按来源的批量操作以 精确相等匹配，``None`` 与 ``None`` 也相等。"
msgstr "``by``: source or owner identifier. ``None`` is allowed; batch operations by source match by exact equality, and ``None`` equals ``None``."

#: flowing.lists.Togglable:16 of
msgid "``tags``：标签列表。按标签的批量操作以“列表中任一元素与给定 标签相等”匹配。"
msgstr "``tags``: tag list. Batch operations by tag match on \"any element of the list equals the given tag\"."

#: flowing.lists.Togglable:18 of
msgid ""
"注意对照：``flowing.tool.ToolEntry`` 与 ``flowing.plugins.skills.SkillEntry`` "
"只有 ``enabled`` 一个 同名字段（Agent 级绑定层条目，存于按别名索引的 dict，不进 "
"``ManagedList``）——它们**不满足**本协议，不享有按 by/tags 的整组管理。"
msgstr ""
"Note the contrast: ``flowing.tool.ToolEntry`` and ``flowing.plugins.skills.SkillEntry`` have only one same-named field, ``enabled`` "
"(Agent-level binding-layer entries, stored in an alias-indexed dict, not in a "
"``ManagedList``) — they do **not** satisfy this protocol and do not enjoy by/tags whole-group management."

#: flowing.lists.Togglable:24 of
msgid ""
":class:`ManagedList`、:class:`flowing.hooks.HookEntry`、 "
":class:`flowing.context.PromptBlock`"
msgstr ""
":class:`ManagedList`, :class:`flowing.hooks.HookEntry`, "
":class:`flowing.context.PromptBlock`"

#: flowing.hooks.Togglable.enabled:1 flowing.lists.Togglable.enabled:1 of
msgid ""
"启用标记。``True`` 表示启用：条目参与迭代，进而参与钩子分发、 上下文组装等消费路径。``False`` 表示停用：条目被迭代跳过，但仍 "
"保留在容器中、注册顺序不变，调用对应的 ``enable_*`` 方法可恢复。"
msgstr ""
"Enable flag. ``True`` means enabled: the entry participates in iteration, and thereby in hook dispatch, context assembly, and other consumption "
"paths. ``False`` means disabled: the entry is skipped during iteration but remains in the container with registration order unchanged, and can be restored via the corresponding ``enable_*`` method."

#: flowing.hooks.Togglable.by:1 flowing.lists.Togglable.by:1 of
msgid ""
"来源或所有者标识，供 ``disable_by_owner`` / ``enable_by_owner`` / "
"``remove_by_owner`` 按来源批量操作时精确匹配。允许 ``None``：按 ``item.by == owner`` 判断相等时"
" ``None`` 与 ``None`` 也相等，因此 ``disable_by_owner(None)`` "
"一类调用能命中注册时未提供来源的条目。"
msgstr ""
"Source or owner identifier, matched exactly by ``disable_by_owner`` / ``enable_by_owner`` / "
"``remove_by_owner`` during batch-by-source operations. ``None`` is allowed: when judging equality by ``item.by == owner``, "
"``None`` equals ``None``, so calls like ``disable_by_owner(None)`` "
"can hit entries registered without a source."

#: flowing.hooks.Togglable.tags:1 flowing.lists.Togglable.tags:1 of
msgid ""
"标签列表（``list[str]``，可为空、可含多个），供 ``disable_by_tag`` / ``enable_by_tag`` / "
"``remove_by_tag`` 按标签 批量操作时匹配。匹配规则：列表中任一元素与给定标签相等即命中。"
msgstr ""
"Tag list (``list[str]``, may be empty, may contain multiple), matched by ``disable_by_tag`` / ``enable_by_tag`` / "
"``remove_by_tag`` during batch-by-tag operations. Matching rule: any element of the list equal to the given tag is a hit."

#: flowing.hooks.PatternRegistrar:1 of
msgid "``hook[\"pattern\"](handler)`` 语法糖返回的注册器。"
msgstr "The registrar returned by the ``hook[\"pattern\"](handler)`` sugar."

#: flowing.hooks.PatternRegistrar:5 of
msgid ""
":meth:`HookList.__getitem__` 传入 ``str`` 时返回本对象；调用它即完成 “仅当 value 的 "
"``match_on`` 属性匹配 pattern 时才执行”的 handler 注册。"
msgstr ""
"Returned by :meth:`HookList.__getitem__` when a ``str`` is passed; calling it completes the registration of a handler that "
"runs \"only when the value's ``match_on`` attribute matches the pattern\"."

#: flowing.hooks.PatternRegistrar:9 of
msgid ""
"“按名称过滤注册”是高频需求（只对 ``payment-*`` 工具做审批）。 独立 Registrar 类型使 "
"``hook[\"pattern\"]`` 与 ``hook(handler)`` 共享 同一调用形态，注册产物仍是普通 "
":class:`HookEntry` （``pattern`` 字段 非空），因此分组管理、注册顺序、分发算法完全一致，无第二套语义。"
msgstr ""
"\"Filter-by-name registration\" is a high-frequency need (approving only ``payment-*`` tools). A standalone Registrar type lets "
"``hook[\"pattern\"]`` and ``hook(handler)`` share the same calling form, and the registration product is still an ordinary "
":class:`HookEntry` (with a non-empty ``pattern`` field), so group management, registration order, and the dispatch algorithm are identical — no second set of semantics."

#: flowing.hooks.PatternRegistrar:23 of
msgid ""
"调用即构造 ``HookEntry(handler=..., by=..., tags=..., pattern=<pattern>)`` "
"并追加到所属 :class:`HookList` 末尾；返回被注册的原 handler（装饰器 形态不遮蔽被装饰名；需要 "
":class:`HookEntry` 句柄时经 ``HookList`` 的 ``int`` / ``slice`` 索引或批量管理 API "
"获取）。"
msgstr ""
"Calling it constructs ``HookEntry(handler=..., by=..., tags=..., pattern=<pattern>)`` "
"and appends it to the end of the owning :class:`HookList`; returns the registered original handler (the decorator form does not shadow the decorated name; when a "
":class:`HookEntry` handle is needed, get it via ``HookList``'s ``int`` / ``slice`` indexing or the batch management API)."

#: flowing.hooks.PatternRegistrar:27 of
msgid "不匹配时 handler 不被调用，value 原样透传，不影响链的传递。"
msgstr "When not matching, the handler is not called and the value passes through unchanged, without affecting the chain's propagation."

#: flowing.hooks.PatternRegistrar:28 of
msgid ""
"pattern 过滤在分发时按 entry 惰性求值（而非注册时生成包装函数）， 使 ``entry.pattern`` 可观测、可随 "
"disable / enable 整体管理。"
msgstr ""
"Pattern filtering is lazily evaluated per entry at dispatch time (rather than generating a wrapper function at registration time), "
"so ``entry.pattern`` is observable and can be managed as a whole with disable / enable."

#: flowing.hooks.PatternRegistrar:30 of
msgid ""
"边缘情况：对 value 不具有 ``match_on`` 属性的钩子点做 pattern 注册， 注册本身成功；分发时 ``getattr`` "
"失败按 handler 普通异常规则直接 上抛（属编程错误，不做兜底）。"
msgstr ""
"Edge case: pattern-registering on a hook point whose value lacks the ``match_on`` attribute succeeds at registration; at dispatch, "
"the ``getattr`` failure propagates directly per the ordinary-exception rule for handlers (a programming error, no fallback)."

#: flowing.hooks.PatternRegistrar:36 of
msgid ":meth:`HookList.__getitem__`、:class:`HookEntry`、 :attr:`HookList.match_on`"
msgstr ":meth:`HookList.__getitem__`, :class:`HookEntry`, :attr:`HookList.match_on`"

#: ../../api/flowing.rst:65
msgid "flowing.lists module"
msgstr "flowing.lists module"

#: flowing.lists:1 of
msgid "flowing.lists —— 一批带来源与标签的可开关条目的分组管理容器（``ManagedList`` / ``Togglable``）。"
msgstr "flowing.lists — grouped management containers (``ManagedList`` / ``Togglable``) for a batch of toggleable entries with source and tags."

#: flowing.lists:5 of
msgid ""
"本模块提供“一批带来源与标签的可开关条目”的统一管理：:class:`ManagedList` "
"负责按标签（tag）或来源（owner）批量停用、恢复或删除条目，迭代时自动 跳过已停用条目；:class:`Togglable` "
"是条目需要满足的最小结构契约。适合 “按组临时停用一批能力、稍后整组恢复”的场景；框架内 "
":class:`flowing.hooks.HookList` 与 "
":class:`flowing.context.PromptBlockList` 都基于本模块实现。"
msgstr ""
"This module provides unified management of \"a batch of toggleable entries with source and tags\": :class:`ManagedList` "
"handles batch disabling, restoring, or deleting entries by tag or owner, and automatically skips disabled entries during iteration; :class:`Togglable` "
"is the minimal structural contract entries must satisfy. Suitable for scenarios like \"temporarily disable a group of capabilities and restore "
"the whole group later\"; in the framework, :class:`flowing.hooks.HookList` and "
":class:`flowing.context.PromptBlockList` are both built on this module."

#: flowing.lists:12 of
msgid "本模块只提供容器管理：不规定条目除 :class:`Togglable` 三个属性之外的 任何字段，也不关心条目的业务含义。"
msgstr "This module only provides container management: it does not prescribe any fields of entries beyond the three :class:`Togglable` attributes, nor does it care about entries' business meaning."

#: flowing.lists:36 of
msgid ""
"停用只把条目的 ``enabled`` 字段置为 ``False``：条目保留在容器中、 "
"注册顺序不变、可随时恢复；删除才是把条目彻底移除、不可恢复。"
msgstr ""
"Disabling only sets the entry's ``enabled`` field to ``False``: the entry remains in the container, "
"registration order is unchanged, and it can be restored at any time; deletion is what truly removes an entry, irreversibly."

#: flowing.lists:38 of
msgid "容器内条目的相对顺序等于注册顺序，停用与恢复不改变顺序。"
msgstr "The relative order of entries in the container equals the registration order; disabling and restoring do not change the order."

#: flowing.lists:39 of
msgid ""
"按来源的匹配是精确相等（``item.by == owner``，``None`` 与 ``None`` "
"也相等）；按标签的匹配是“``tags`` 列表中任一元素与给定标签相等 即命中”。"
msgstr ""
"Matching by source is exact equality (``item.by == owner``, and ``None`` equals ``None``); "
"matching by tag is \"any element of the ``tags`` list equals the given tag\"."

#: flowing.lists:43 of
msgid ""
":class:`Togglable`、:class:`ManagedList`、 "
":class:`flowing.hooks.HookList`、:class:`flowing.context.PromptBlockList`"
msgstr ""
":class:`Togglable`, :class:`ManagedList`, "
":class:`flowing.hooks.HookList`, :class:`flowing.context.PromptBlockList`"

#: ../../api/flowing.rst:73
msgid "flowing.message module"
msgstr "flowing.message module"

#: flowing.message:1 of
msgid "``flowing.message`` —— 对象层消息模型、消息队列与消息级树手术。"
msgstr "``flowing.message`` — the object-layer message model, message queue, and message-level tree surgery."

#: flowing.message:5 of
msgid ""
"本模块定义 Flowing 的对象层消息表示（与任何 Provider API 的 ``role`` 字段、任何 UI 渲染样式解耦）、Agent"
" 的消息队列（优先级排序 + 同级 FIFO）， 以及消息级树的手术入口 :class:`MessageChain`。"
msgstr ""
"This module defines Flowing's object-layer message representation (decoupled from any Provider API's ``role`` field and any UI rendering style), the Agent's "
"message queue (priority ordering + same-level FIFO), and :class:`MessageChain`, the entry point for message-level tree surgery."

#: flowing.message:9 of
msgid "职责边界："
msgstr "Responsibility boundaries:"

#: flowing.message:11 of
msgid "消息的产生与表示：任意来源（用户、LLM、工具、外部 Agent、系统事件） 产生的新信息统一表示为 :class:`Message`。"
msgstr "Message production and representation: new information from any source (user, LLM, tools, external agents, system events) is uniformly represented as :class:`Message`."

#: flowing.message:13 of
msgid ""
"消息的组织结构：消息级树（允许多根的森林）——树节点 = 消息， ``Message.id`` + ``Message.parent_id`` "
"构成亲代链；``parent_id=None`` 是根标记，一棵树允许多个根（根集合 = 全部 ``parent_id=None`` 的 "
"消息），新根由 :meth:`MessageChain.branch` 以 ``parent_id=None`` "
"开启（典型场景：上下文压缩换链——摘要作为新根开新链，旧树完整保留）。 不设虚拟根节点。``Agent.current_head_id`` "
"指向某条消息的 id；fork 只切视角、从不创建节点。"
msgstr ""
"Message organization structure: the message-level tree (a forest allowing multiple roots) — tree nodes = messages, ``Message.id`` + ``Message.parent_id`` "
"form the parent chain; ``parent_id=None`` is the root marker, and a tree allows multiple roots (the root set = all messages "
"with ``parent_id=None``); new roots are opened by :meth:`MessageChain.branch` with ``parent_id=None`` "
"(typical scenario: context compaction switches chains — the summary opens a new chain as a new root while the old tree is fully preserved). No virtual root node. ``Agent.current_head_id`` "
"points to some message's id; fork only switches the viewpoint and never creates nodes."

#: flowing.message:20 of
msgid ""
"消息的排队与调度：外部消息经 :class:`MessageQueue` 按优先级排序消费； ``MessageKind.PROVIDER`` "
"永不进队列（永远在逻辑 turn 内由 Provider adapter 产生）。"
msgstr ""
"Message queuing and scheduling: external messages are consumed via :class:`MessageQueue` sorted by priority; ``MessageKind.PROVIDER`` "
"never enters the queue (it is always produced by the Provider adapter within a logical turn)."

#: flowing.message:23 of
msgid ""
"消息的持久化与手术：一行一个 Message、消息完整后 append（append-only）； 任意历史修改走 "
":class:`MessageChain` 五 op。tombstone（删除标记行）/ 撕裂末行容忍 / 压缩等持久化机制属 "
":mod:`flowing.persistence` 与 ``flowing.agent`` 的职责，本模块只约束“消息对象 ↔ 行”的映射语义 "
"（:func:`to_record` / :func:`from_record`）。"
msgstr ""
"Message persistence and surgery: one Message per line, appended once the message is complete (append-only); any historical modification goes through "
":class:`MessageChain`'s five ops. Persistence mechanisms such as tombstones (deletion marker lines), torn-last-line tolerance, and compaction belong "
"to :mod:`flowing.persistence` and ``flowing.agent``; this module only constrains the mapping semantics of \"message object ↔ line\" "
"(:func:`to_record` / :func:`from_record`)."

#: flowing.message:29 of
msgid ""
"逻辑 Turn 只是执行概念：消费一条消息 → 产生一条 ``turn_end=True`` 的 PROVIDER 消息（或被 "
"abort）的过程；执行期载体是 ``flowing.agent.TurnContext`` （不落盘、不进树、崩溃后不恢复）。"
msgstr ""
"A logical Turn is only an execution concept: the process of consuming one message and producing one ``turn_end=True`` PROVIDER message (or being "
"aborted); its execution-time carrier is ``flowing.agent.TurnContext`` (not persisted, not in the tree, not recovered after a crash)."

#: flowing.message:33 of
msgid "Message 字段规约总表："
msgstr "Message field spec summary table:"

#: flowing.message:40 of
msgid "规约要点"
msgstr "Key spec points"

#: flowing.message:41 of
msgid "``id``"
msgstr "``id``"

#: flowing.message:42 of
msgid "Agent 内自增序列号（纯数字字符串），同时是消息级树的节点 id；缺省 ``None`` 由 Agent 边界铸造"
msgstr "Auto-increment sequence number within the Agent (pure digit string), also the node id of the message-level tree; default ``None`` is minted at the Agent boundary"

#: flowing.message:43 of
msgid "``parent_id``"
msgstr "``parent_id``"

#: flowing.message:44 of
msgid "消息级亲代链；``None`` = 根标记（允许多根，森林模型）；树上溯与上下文组装的唯一依据"
msgstr "Message-level parent chain; ``None`` = root marker (multiple roots allowed, forest model); the sole basis for tree traversal and context assembly"

#: flowing.message:45 of
msgid "``kind``"
msgstr "``kind``"

#: flowing.message:46 of
msgid "对象层唯一角色判别，八值枚举 :class:`MessageKind`；消息没有 ``role`` 属性"
msgstr "The object layer's only role discriminator, the eight-value enum :class:`MessageKind`; messages have no ``role`` attribute"

#: flowing.message:47 of
msgid "``content``"
msgstr "``content``"

#: flowing.message:48 of
msgid ":class:`ContentBlock` 列表，不同 type 可交错排列"
msgstr ":class:`ContentBlock` list; blocks of different types may interleave"

#: flowing.message:49 of
msgid "``turn_end``"
msgstr "``turn_end``"

#: flowing.message:50 of
msgid "逻辑 turn 关闭的边界标记；由 agent 层在挂树时写入（turn 随本条消息关闭 → ``True``）"
msgstr "Boundary marker for closing a logical turn; written by the agent layer when attaching to the tree (turn closes with this message → ``True``)"

#: flowing.message:51 of
msgid "``partial``"
msgstr "``partial``"

#: flowing.message:52 of
msgid "流式中断的未完成消息标记；中断时已累积内容保留落盘（非丢弃）"
msgstr "Marker for an unfinished message interrupted mid-stream; accumulated content at interruption is persisted (not discarded)"

#: flowing.message:53 of
msgid "``synthetic``"
msgstr "``synthetic``"

#: flowing.message:54 of
msgid "``True`` = 恢复时合成的占位消息（孤立 tool_call 的占位 TOOL 消息），非真实产物"
msgstr "``True`` = placeholder message synthesized at recovery time (placeholder TOOL message for an orphaned tool_call), not a real artifact"

#: flowing.message:55 of
msgid "``tool_call_id``"
msgstr "``tool_call_id``"

#: flowing.message:56 of
msgid ""
"配对锚（仅 ``kind=TOOL`` 非 ``None``）：与 PROVIDER 消息 ``ToolCallBlock.id`` 1:1 "
"严格成对"
msgstr ""
"Pairing anchor (non-``None`` only for ``kind=TOOL``): strictly paired 1:1 with the ``ToolCallBlock.id`` "
"of a PROVIDER message"

#: flowing.message:57 of
msgid "``tool_status``"
msgstr "``tool_status``"

#: flowing.message:58 of
msgid "工具结果状态四值（仅 ``kind=TOOL`` 非 ``None``）；``__post_init__`` 双向强制"
msgstr "Four-value tool result status (non-``None`` only for ``kind=TOOL``); enforced both ways by ``__post_init__``"

#: flowing.message:59 of
msgid "``source``"
msgstr "``source``"

#: flowing.message:60 of
msgid "自由字符串二级分类（框架不枚举），投递方填写"
msgstr "Free-form string secondary classification (not enumerated by the framework), filled in by the deliverer"

#: flowing.message:61 of
msgid "``tags``"
msgstr "``tags``"

#: flowing.message:62 of
msgid "任意标签列表，用于分组 / 过滤 / 清洗"
msgstr "Arbitrary tag list, for grouping / filtering / cleaning"

#: flowing.message:63 of
msgid "``priority``"
msgstr "``priority``"

#: flowing.message:64 of
msgid "队列排序依据（``INTERRUPT > STEER > HIGH > NORMAL > LOW``）"
msgstr "Queue ordering basis (``INTERRUPT > STEER > HIGH > NORMAL > LOW``)"

#: flowing.message:65 of
msgid "``timestamp``"
msgstr "``timestamp``"

#: flowing.message:66 of
msgid "时区无关（UTC / epoch）；附着于消息，是否进 LLM 上下文由 adapter 决定"
msgstr "Timezone-agnostic (UTC / epoch); attached to the message; whether it enters the LLM context is decided by the adapter"

#: flowing.message:67 of
msgid "``usage``"
msgstr "``usage``"

#: flowing.message:68 of
msgid "本消息对应的 Provider 实测用量（仅 PROVIDER 消息携带），随消息落盘、恢复后仍在"
msgstr "The Provider's measured usage corresponding to this message (carried only by PROVIDER messages); persisted with the message and still present after recovery"

#: flowing.message:70 of
msgid "kind → API role 发送映射（Provider adapter 职责）："
msgstr "kind → API role send mapping (Provider adapter responsibility):"

#: flowing.message:76 of
msgid "Anthropic"
msgstr "Anthropic"

#: flowing.message:77 of
msgid "OpenAI"
msgstr "OpenAI"

#: flowing.message:78 of
msgid "Gemini"
msgstr "Gemini"

#: flowing.message:80 flowing.message:81 flowing.message:82 flowing.message:94
#: flowing.message:97 flowing.message:98 flowing.message:101
#: flowing.message:102 flowing.message:105 flowing.message:109 of
msgid "``user``"
msgstr "``user``"

#: flowing.message:84 flowing.message:85 of
msgid "``assistant``"
msgstr "``assistant``"

#: flowing.message:86 of
msgid "``model``"
msgstr "``model``"

#: flowing.message:88 of
msgid "``user`` （tool_result）"
msgstr "``user`` (tool_result)"

#: flowing.message:89 flowing.message:90 of
msgid "``tool``"
msgstr "``tool``"

#: flowing.message:92 flowing.message:96 flowing.message:100 of
msgid "``user`` （XML 包裹）"
msgstr "``user`` (XML wrapped)"

#: flowing.message:93 of
msgid "``system``"
msgstr "``system``"

#: flowing.message:103 of
msgid "``PLUGIN``"
msgstr "``PLUGIN``"

#: flowing.message:104 flowing.message:108 of
msgid "独立消息，XML 包裹（格式由 adapter 定）"
msgstr "Standalone message, XML wrapped (format decided by the adapter)"

#: flowing.message:106 flowing.message:110 of
msgid "同左"
msgstr "Same as left"

#: flowing.message:107 of
msgid "``SUBAGENT``"
msgstr "``SUBAGENT``"

#: flowing.message:112 of
msgid ""
"OpenAI 侧 PLUGIN / SUBAGENT 落 ``user`` role（XML 包裹）：外部结果 回喂属“输入”，不落 "
"``developer`` （避免给外部数据提指令权），更不伪造 ``assistant`` （会破坏轮次语义与 tool_calls 配对）。"
msgstr ""
"On the OpenAI side, PLUGIN / SUBAGENT land on the ``user`` role (XML wrapped): feeding back external results is \"input\" — it does not land on "
"``developer`` (to avoid granting external data instruction authority), and certainly does not fake ``assistant`` (which would break turn semantics and tool_calls pairing)."

#: flowing.message:115 of
msgid ""
"SYSTEM / PEER / EVENT / PLUGIN / SUBAGENT 的 XML 包裹格式由 adapter 按 Provider "
"能力决定，框架核心不约束具体格式。"
msgstr ""
"The XML wrapping format for SYSTEM / PEER / EVENT / PLUGIN / SUBAGENT is decided by the adapter according to Provider "
"capabilities; the framework core does not constrain the concrete format."

#: flowing.message:117 of
msgid ""
"“某 block type 出现在哪些 kind 中”是典型情况而非硬约束；不合法排列 （如 PROVIDER 消息含 image block）由"
" Provider adapter 在组装 API 请求时验证并报错，框架核心不验证。"
msgstr ""
"\"Which block types appear in which kinds\" describes typical cases, not hard constraints; invalid arrangements (e.g. a PROVIDER message containing an "
"image block) are validated and reported by the Provider adapter when assembling the API request — the framework core does not validate."

#: flowing.message:121 of
msgid "入队规则："
msgstr "Enqueue rules:"

#: flowing.message:123 of
msgid ""
"进队列：``USER`` / ``EVENT`` / ``PEER`` / ``PLUGIN`` / ``SUBAGENT`` / "
"``SYSTEM`` （可选）/ 异步工具最终结果（以 ``EVENT`` kind 入队， "
"``source=\"tool_result\"``，多块 content = 标注块 + 结果块）。``TOOL`` kind "
"本身不入队——同步工具结果在逻辑 turn 内经挂树直接进入消息树。"
msgstr ""
"Enqueued: ``USER`` / ``EVENT`` / ``PEER`` / ``PLUGIN`` / ``SUBAGENT`` / "
"``SYSTEM`` (optional) / async tool final results (enqueued with ``EVENT`` kind, "
"``source=\"tool_result\"``, multi-block content = annotation block + result block). The ``TOOL`` kind "
"itself is not enqueued — sync tool results enter the message tree directly via tree attachment within the logical turn."

#: flowing.message:127 of
msgid "不进队列：``PROVIDER``——永远在逻辑 turn 内产生。"
msgstr "Not enqueued: ``PROVIDER`` — always produced within a logical turn."

#: flowing.message:128 of
msgid ""
"``SYSTEM`` 双通道：经队列投递（触发新逻辑 turn），或由上下文组装内部 注入本 turn 的 system prompt "
"段（不触发新 turn）。"
msgstr ""
"``SYSTEM`` dual channel: delivered via the queue (triggers a new logical turn), or injected internally by context assembly into this turn's system prompt "
"segment (does not trigger a new turn)."

#: flowing.message:130 of
msgid ""
"kind 无行为含义：消息类型只决定 adapter 的呈现映射（见上表），不改变 turn 语义——任何入队批次都正常开回合、正常调用 "
"LLM，不存在“纯系统 消息不触发 LLM 调用”之类的短路。"
msgstr ""
"kind has no behavioral meaning: the message type only determines the adapter's presentation mapping (see the table above) and does not change turn semantics — "
"any enqueued batch opens a turn and calls the LLM normally; there is no short-circuit like \"pure system messages don't trigger LLM calls\"."

#: flowing.message:134 of
msgid "流式与 partial："
msgstr "Streaming and partial:"

#: flowing.message:136 of
msgid ""
"流式中断（abort）时，已累积内容以 ``partial=True`` 的消息保留落盘， 而不是丢弃；正常完成的消息恒为 "
"``partial=False``。"
msgstr ""
"On stream interruption (abort), accumulated content is persisted as a ``partial=True`` message instead of being discarded; normally completed messages are always "
"``partial=False``."

#: flowing.message:138 of
msgid "``on_provider_delta`` 钩子收到的 delta 本身不落盘（volatile），中断时 的已累积内容作为持久化状态保留。"
msgstr "The delta received by the ``on_provider_delta`` hook is itself not persisted (volatile); the accumulated content at interruption is retained as persistent state."

#: flowing.message:160 of
msgid ""
"媒体块一律 base64 内联（``data`` 必填且是权威表示）：消息层不感知 "
"“文件最初从哪来”，也不做文件大小检查（大小治理分层：前端上传前校验 / ``before_enqueue`` 钩子 / Provider "
"adapter 的 ``ContextLengthError`` 兜底）。"
msgstr ""
"Media blocks are always base64-inlined (``data`` is required and is the authoritative representation): the message layer is agnostic about "
"\"where the file originally came from\" and does no file-size checks (size governance is layered: front-end validation before upload / the ``before_enqueue`` hook / the Provider "
"adapter's ``ContextLengthError`` as the final fallback)."

#: flowing.message:164 of
msgid "历史消息不可在应用层直接修改——修改历史走 :class:`MessageChain` 五 op 或 fork（切分支）。"
msgstr "Historical messages must not be modified directly at the application layer — modifying history goes through :class:`MessageChain`'s five ops or fork (branch switching)."

#: flowing.message:166 of
msgid ""
"本模块只提供机制：优先级排序队列、五 op 手术原语、媒体 base64 统一编码。 策略（防饿死加权、drain "
"合并、何时压缩上下文、摘要如何生成）由覆写 ``Agent._dequeue()``、Composable 或应用层决定。"
msgstr ""
"This module only provides mechanisms: a priority-sorted queue, five surgery primitives, unified base64 encoding for media. Policies (anti-starvation "
"weighting, drain merging, when to compact context, how to generate summaries) are decided by overriding ``Agent._dequeue()``, composables, or the application layer."

#: flowing.message:172 of
msgid ""
":class:`flowing.agent.Agent` （消息队列与工作循环的宿主； ``Agent.chain`` 是 "
":class:`MessageChain` 的访问入口） :class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext` （逻辑 turn "
"的执行期临时对象： ``started_at`` / ``message_ids`` / ``aborted`` / "
"``pending_messages`` / ``usages``） :mod:`flowing.tool` （``ToolCall`` / "
"``ToolResult`` 的定义处，与 block 形式互转） :mod:`flowing.context` （``Context`` / "
"``PromptBlock`` / ``PromptSegment`` ——上下文组装产物）"
msgstr ""
":class:`flowing.agent.Agent` (host of the message queue and work loop; ``Agent.chain`` is "
"the access entry to :class:`MessageChain`) :class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext` (the execution-time temporary object of a logical turn: "
"``started_at`` / ``message_ids`` / ``aborted`` / "
"``pending_messages`` / ``usages``) :mod:`flowing.tool` (where ``ToolCall`` / "
"``ToolResult`` are defined, convertible to and from block form) :mod:`flowing.context` (``Context`` / "
"``PromptBlock`` / ``PromptSegment`` — context assembly products)"

#: flowing.message.VideoBlock:1 of
msgid "视频内容块（时间维度连续帧）。"
msgstr "Video content block (temporally continuous frames)."

#: flowing.message.VideoBlock:5 of
msgid "视频输入。多数 Provider 不原生支持视频——降级策略属 adapter / UI 层（首帧截图、转为文件引用或略过），框架核心只做承载。"
msgstr "Video input. Most Providers do not natively support video — degradation strategies belong to the adapter / UI layer (first-frame screenshot, converting to a file reference, or skipping); the framework core only carries it."

#: flowing.message.VideoBlock:10 of
msgid "字段与 :class:`MediaBlock` 一致；``type`` 固定 ``\"video\"``。"
msgstr "Fields are identical to :class:`MediaBlock`; ``type`` is fixed to ``\"video\"``."

#: flowing.message.VideoBlock:11 of
msgid "与 :class:`ImageBlock` 的边界：单帧静态用 ``image``；连续帧用 ``video``。"
msgstr "Boundary with :class:`ImageBlock`: a single static frame uses ``image``; continuous frames use ``video``."

#: flowing.message.VideoBlock:15 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.message.MediaBlock`、 :class:`flowing.message.ImageBlock`。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.message.MediaBlock`, :class:`flowing.message.ImageBlock`."

#: flowing.message.VideoBlock.type:1 of
msgid "固定为 ``\"video\"``。"
msgstr "Fixed to ``\"video\"``."

#: flowing.message.AudioBlock:1 of
msgid "音频内容块（需要语音理解时使用）。"
msgstr "Audio content block (used when speech understanding is needed)."

#: flowing.message.AudioBlock:5 of
msgid ""
"语音 / 音频输入。不支持的 Provider 由 adapter 降级（``<audio>`` 占位文本或语音转文字）；仅传递 ``.mp3``"
" 等文件而无需理解时用 :class:`FileBlock`。"
msgstr ""
"Speech / audio input. Providers that do not support it are degraded by the adapter (``<audio>`` placeholder text or speech-to-text); use :class:`FileBlock` "
"when you merely pass a ``.mp3``-style file without needing understanding."

#: flowing.message.AudioBlock:11 of
msgid "字段与 :class:`MediaBlock` 一致；``type`` 固定 ``\"audio\"``。"
msgstr "Fields are identical to :class:`MediaBlock`; ``type`` is fixed to ``\"audio\"``."

#: flowing.message.AudioBlock:14 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.message.MediaBlock`、 :class:`flowing.message.FileBlock`。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.message.MediaBlock`, :class:`flowing.message.FileBlock`."

#: flowing.message.AudioBlock.type:1 of
msgid "固定为 ``\"audio\"``。"
msgstr "Fixed to ``\"audio\"``."

#: flowing.message.MEDIA_TOKEN_ESTIMATE:1 of
msgid "单个媒体块的固定 token 估算值。"
msgstr "Fixed token estimate for a single media block."

#: flowing.message.MEDIA_TOKEN_ESTIMATE:3 of
msgid ""
"消息层媒体一律 base64 内联，但其 token 成本由 provider 按图像 / 媒体 规格定档，与 base64 "
"长度无关——按字符数估会失真几个数量级，故 :func:`estimate_message_tokens` 对 "
":class:`MediaBlock` 及其子类固定计 此常数、不看内容。"
msgstr ""
"Message-layer media are always base64-inlined, but their token cost is tiered by the provider according to image / media "
"specifications and is unrelated to base64 length — estimating by character count would be off by orders of magnitude, so :func:`estimate_message_tokens` counts "
"this constant for :class:`MediaBlock` and its subclasses, ignoring content."

#: flowing.message.estimate_message_tokens:1 of
msgid "估算一条消息的 token 数（字符启发式，仅供上下文窗口预算观测）。"
msgstr "Estimate the token count of a message (character heuristic, for context window budget observation only)."

#: flowing.message.estimate_message_tokens:5 of
msgid ""
"对消息逐块展开的本地估算：文本类块（``TextBlock.text`` / ``ThinkingBlock.thinking``）与 "
"``ToolCallBlock`` 的 ``name`` + JSON 序列化参数、``StructBlock`` 的 "
"``json.dumps`` 序列化长度均按 字符启发式计；``MediaBlock`` 及其子类固定计 "
":data:`MEDIA_TOKEN_ESTIMATE`。被 "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.estimate_context_tokens` 用于估算—— "
"锚点指最近一条携带实测用量（``Message.usage``）的消息，估算覆盖 锚点之后（或无锚点时全部）路径上的消息。"
msgstr ""
"A local estimate expanded block by block: text-like blocks (``TextBlock.text`` / ``ThinkingBlock.thinking``), "
"``ToolCallBlock``'s ``name`` + JSON-serialized args, and ``StructBlock``'s "
"``json.dumps`` serialized length are all counted by the character heuristic; ``MediaBlock`` and its subclasses count the fixed "
":data:`MEDIA_TOKEN_ESTIMATE`. Used by "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.estimate_context_tokens` for estimation — "
"the anchor is the most recent message carrying measured usage (``Message.usage``), and the estimate covers messages on the path after the anchor (or all of them when there is no anchor)."

#: flowing.message.estimate_message_tokens:14 of
msgid ""
"字符启发式口径：ASCII 约 4 字符/token、非 ASCII（CJK 等）约 1 字符/token——中文场景下远优于统一除以 4。不用 "
"tokenizer：估算只 服务于“该不该压缩、还剩多少余量”这类窗口预算判断（±20% 足够）， 永不用于计费（计费走 "
"``TurnResult.token_usage`` 聚合，数据源是 ``Message.usage`` 实测）。"
msgstr ""
"Character heuristic calibration: ASCII ~4 chars/token, non-ASCII (CJK etc.) ~1 char/token — far better than uniformly dividing by 4 in Chinese scenarios. "
"No tokenizer is used: the estimate only serves window-budget judgments like \"should we compact, how much headroom remains\" (±20% suffices), and is never "
"used for billing (billing aggregates via ``TurnResult.token_usage``, sourced from measured ``Message.usage``)."

#: flowing.message.estimate_message_tokens:28 of
msgid "同步纯函数：只读 ``msg``，无副作用、无缓存，每次现场求值。"
msgstr "Synchronous pure function: only reads ``msg``, no side effects, no caching, evaluated on the spot each time."

#: flowing.message.estimate_message_tokens:29 of
msgid ""
"逐块规则：文本类块按（ASCII 字符数 ÷ 4 + 非 ASCII 字符数）向上 取整；``ToolCallBlock`` 计 ``name``"
" 与 ``args`` JSON 序列化后的 字符启发式之和；``StructBlock`` 计 "
"``json.dumps(ensure_ascii=False)`` 结果的字符启发式；``MediaBlock`` 族固定 "
"``MEDIA_TOKEN_ESTIMATE``，不读 base64 ``data``。"
msgstr ""
"Per-block rules: text-like blocks count ceil(ASCII char count ÷ 4 + non-ASCII char count); ``ToolCallBlock`` counts the character-heuristic sum of ``name`` "
"plus the JSON-serialized ``args``; ``StructBlock`` counts the character heuristic of the "
"``json.dumps(ensure_ascii=False)`` result; the ``MediaBlock`` family counts the fixed "
"``MEDIA_TOKEN_ESTIMATE`` without reading the base64 ``data``."

#: flowing.message.estimate_message_tokens:34 of
msgid "不计入：消息元数据（``id`` / ``source`` / ``tags`` 等）不进 LLM 上下文，不参与估算。"
msgstr "Not counted: message metadata (``id`` / ``source`` / ``tags`` etc.) does not enter the LLM context and does not participate in the estimate."

#: flowing.message.estimate_message_tokens:36 of
msgid "边缘情况：空 ``content`` 返回 0；未知块类型按“无文本内容”计 0。"
msgstr "Edge cases: empty ``content`` returns 0; unknown block types count 0 as \"no text content\"."

#: flowing.message.estimate_message_tokens:39 of
msgid ""
":data:`MEDIA_TOKEN_ESTIMATE`、 "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.estimate_context_tokens`。"
msgstr ""
":data:`MEDIA_TOKEN_ESTIMATE`, "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.estimate_context_tokens`."

#: flowing.message.to_record:1 of
msgid "把 ``Message`` 序列化为 ``tree.jsonl`` 的一行（JSON 兼容 dict）。"
msgstr "Serialize a ``Message`` into one line of ``tree.jsonl`` (a JSON-compatible dict)."

#: flowing.message.to_record:5 of
msgid ""
"消息对象与持久化行映射的序列化点（:func:`from_record` 的逆映射）。 行格式的字段级 schema 冻结在本函数与 "
":func:`from_record` 一对中， ``Agent._persist_message`` 以本函数为唯一序列化点。"
msgstr ""
"The serialization point of the message-object-to-persistence-line mapping (the inverse of :func:`from_record`). The field-level schema of the line "
"format is frozen in this function–:func:`from_record` pair, and ``Agent._persist_message`` uses this function as its sole serialization point."

#: flowing.message.to_record:9 of
msgid "落盘行格式（JSON 对象）："
msgstr "On-disk line format (JSON object):"

#: flowing.message.to_record:33 of
msgid ""
"``kind`` 落盘为枚举字符串值；``priority`` 落盘为枚举数值； ``timestamp`` 落盘为 ISO 格式（naive "
"UTC）。"
msgstr ""
"``kind`` is persisted as the enum string value; ``priority`` as the enum numeric value; ``timestamp`` in ISO format (naive "
"UTC)."

#: flowing.message.to_record:35 of
msgid "``content`` 逐块序列化，每块含 ``type`` 判别字段。"
msgstr "``content`` is serialized block by block; each block carries a ``type`` discriminator field."

#: flowing.message.to_record:36 of
msgid ""
"``usage`` 为 ``None`` 或七计数字段（``input`` / ``fresh_input`` / ``output`` / "
"``cache_read`` / ``cache_write`` / ``reasoning`` / ``total_tokens``）+ "
"``raw`` 的 dict（存量行的 ``\"usage\": null`` 兼容）。message 不 import "
"providers（单向依赖）， 序列化按 ``Usage`` 的字段名读取，还原端在函数内局部 import。"
msgstr ""
"``usage`` is ``None`` or a dict of seven counter fields (``input`` / ``fresh_input`` / ``output`` / "
"``cache_read`` / ``cache_write`` / ``reasoning`` / ``total_tokens``) + "
"``raw`` (compatible with existing lines' ``\"usage\": null``). message does not import "
"providers (one-way dependency); serialization reads by ``Usage``'s field names, and the restore side does a local import inside the function."

#: flowing.message.to_record:43 of
msgid ":func:`from_record`、:meth:`flowing.agent.Agent._persist_message`。"
msgstr ":func:`from_record`, :meth:`flowing.agent.Agent._persist_message`."

#: flowing.message.from_record:1 of
msgid "把 ``tree.jsonl`` 的一行（dict）还原为 ``Message``。"
msgstr "Restore one line (dict) of ``tree.jsonl`` into a ``Message``."

#: flowing.message.from_record:5 of
msgid "要求 ``record[\"type\"] == \"message\"``，否则抛 ``ValueError``。"
msgstr "Requires ``record[\"type\"] == \"message\"``, otherwise raises ``ValueError``."

#: flowing.message.from_record:6 of
msgid ""
"逐字段还原：``kind`` / ``priority`` 重建为枚举，``timestamp`` 经 "
"``datetime.fromisoformat`` 还原；``usage`` 为 ``None`` 或重建为 "
"``flowing.providers.Usage`` （局部 import——message 不 import providers "
"的单向依赖在运行期无环）。"
msgstr ""
"Field-by-field restore: ``kind`` / ``priority`` are rebuilt as enums, ``timestamp`` is restored via "
"``datetime.fromisoformat``; ``usage`` is ``None`` or rebuilt as "
"``flowing.providers.Usage`` (local import — the one-way dependency of message not importing providers "
"remains acyclic at runtime)."

#: flowing.message.from_record:11 of
msgid "``record`` 不是消息行（``type`` 字段不是 ``\"message\"``）。"
msgstr "``record`` is not a message line (the ``type`` field is not ``\"message\"``)."

#: flowing.message.from_record:15 of
msgid ":func:`to_record`、:meth:`flowing.agent.Agent._restore`。"
msgstr ":func:`to_record`, :meth:`flowing.agent.Agent._restore`."

#: ../../api/flowing.rst:81
msgid "flowing.model module"
msgstr "flowing.model module"

#: flowing.model:1 of
msgid "``flowing.model`` —— 模型规格结构体与模型配置文件加载。"
msgstr "``flowing.model`` — model spec structure and model config file loading."

#: flowing.model:5 of
msgid ""
"本模块承载 Agent 与“用哪个模型说话”之间的契约：模型规格结构体 :class:`ModelConfig` "
"与两个具名加载器——``models.yaml`` 的 :func:`load_models` 与 ``model-tags.yaml`` 的 "
":func:`load_model_tags` （后者只产标签 → 条目名映射，``ModelConfig`` 经两产物 join 得出）。 "
"Provider 侧契约（adapter 继承树 / ``ProviderResponse`` / token 用量 记录 "
":class:`flowing.providers.Usage` / 注册与懒实例化）在 :mod:`flowing.providers` 包。"
msgstr ""
"This module carries the contract between the Agent and \"which model to speak with\": the model spec structure :class:`ModelConfig` "
"and two named loaders — :func:`load_models` for ``models.yaml`` and :func:`load_model_tags` for "
"``model-tags.yaml`` (the latter only produces a tag → entry name mapping; ``ModelConfig`` is obtained by joining the two products). "
"The Provider-side contract (adapter inheritance tree / ``ProviderResponse`` / token usage record "
":class:`flowing.providers.Usage` / registration and lazy instantiation) lives in the :mod:`flowing.providers` package."

#: flowing.model:13 of
msgid ""
"Agent 对模型只做“持有 + 机械传递”：持有 ``self.model: ModelConfig``， 每次 "
"``provider_gen()`` 前现场 ``resolve()`` 求值，再连同 "
":class:`flowing.context.Context` 一起传给 ``Provider.generate()``。 "
"字段含义（``thinking_budget`` 等）只有 Provider adapter 解释，框架 核心不解释任何模型字段。"
msgstr ""
"The Agent only \"holds + mechanically passes\" the model: it holds ``self.model: ModelConfig``, evaluates it on the spot with ``resolve()`` before each "
"``provider_gen()``, and passes it together with "
":class:`flowing.context.Context` to ``Provider.generate()``. "
"Field meanings (``thinking_budget`` etc.) are interpreted only by the Provider adapter; the framework core interprets no model fields."

#: flowing.model:19 of
msgid ""
"模型 ↔ Provider 是 1:1 单值绑定：``ModelConfig.provider`` 是绑定关系 （单个 provider "
"条目名），不是候选列表；``models.yaml`` 每条目只声明 一个具体模型；``model-tags.yaml`` "
"每标签只映射一个模型条目名。没有 内置重试、没有 fallback、没有能力校验。"
msgstr ""
"Model ↔ Provider is a 1:1 single-value binding: ``ModelConfig.provider`` is a binding relation (a single provider "
"entry name), not a candidate list; each ``models.yaml`` entry declares exactly one concrete model; each ``model-tags.yaml`` "
"tag maps to exactly one model entry name. No built-in retry, no fallback, no capability validation."

#: flowing.model:25 of
msgid "配置文件 schema"
msgstr "Config file schema"

#: flowing.model:26 of
msgid ""
"``models.yaml`` （默认 ``$FLOWING_CONFIG_HOME/models.yaml``，可团队 共享，经 "
"``FLOWING_MODELS_PATH`` 重定向）::"
msgstr ""
"``models.yaml`` (default ``$FLOWING_CONFIG_HOME/models.yaml``, team-shareable, redirected via "
"``FLOWING_MODELS_PATH``)::"

#: flowing.model:36 of
msgid "``model-tags.yaml`` （默认 ``$FLOWING_CONFIG_HOME/model-tags.yaml``）::"
msgstr "``model-tags.yaml`` (default ``$FLOWING_CONFIG_HOME/model-tags.yaml``)::"

#: flowing.model:43 of
msgid ""
"标签优先级从高到低：``runtime.set_model_tags(path)`` （代码级，``@/`` "
"前缀指向项目根）、``FLOWING_MODEL_TAGS`` 环境变量指向的文件、默认 ``$FLOWING_CONFIG_HOME"
"/model-tags.yaml``。未定义标签回退 ``default``； ``default`` 也未定义 → 报错（不静默回退）。"
msgstr ""
"Tag priority from high to low: ``runtime.set_model_tags(path)`` (code-level, the ``@/`` "
"prefix points to the project root), the file pointed to by the ``FLOWING_MODEL_TAGS`` environment variable, the default ``$FLOWING_CONFIG_HOME"
"/model-tags.yaml``. Undefined tags fall back to ``default``; if ``default`` is also undefined → error (no silent fallback)."

#: flowing.model:61 of
msgid ""
"两阶段解析：provider 条目（加载时 ``{{env.VAR}}`` 纯字符串替换）与 模型配置（运行时 Parsable "
"求值）的解析表、``{{env.VAR}}`` 替换规则 全文见 :mod:`flowing.providers` 包 "
"docstring。要点：providers.yaml 中的 ``{{env.VAR}}`` 缺失在加载时抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.MissingEnvironmentVariableError` （fail-fast， "
"不静默降级）；``ModelConfig`` 字段中的 ``{{env.VAR}}`` 是运行时 Parsable "
"求值，其失败按普通求值异常处理，不属该异常。"
msgstr ""
"Two-phase resolution: the resolution tables for provider entries (``{{env.VAR}}`` pure string replacement at load time) and model configs (runtime Parsable "
"evaluation), and the full ``{{env.VAR}}`` replacement rules, are in the :mod:`flowing.providers` package "
"docstring. Key points: a missing ``{{env.VAR}}`` in providers.yaml raises at load time "
":class:`flowing.errors.MissingEnvironmentVariableError` (fail-fast, "
"no silent degradation); ``{{env.VAR}}`` in ``ModelConfig`` fields is runtime Parsable "
"evaluation, whose failure is handled as an ordinary evaluation exception, not that error."

#: flowing.model:68 of
msgid ""
"最小行为：用户只写 ``model_tag: fast`` + 三个配置文件时：标签 → 单个模型条目 → 加载凭证 → "
"调用一次；成功返回，失败异常上抛由 ``on_provider_error`` 决定。没有内置重试、没有 fallback、没有能力 校验。"
msgstr ""
"Minimal behavior: when the user only writes ``model_tag: fast`` plus three config files: tag → single model entry → load credentials → "
"one call; success returns, failure raises an exception whose handling is decided by ``on_provider_error``. No built-in retry, no fallback, no capability validation."

#: flowing.model:74 of
msgid "环境变量表（本模块相关）"
msgstr "Environment variable table (relevant to this module)"

#: flowing.model:75 of
msgid "``FLOWING_CONFIG_HOME`` —— 用户级配置目录（默认 ``~/.flowing``， 与 provider 侧共享）。"
msgstr "``FLOWING_CONFIG_HOME`` — user-level config directory (default ``~/.flowing``, shared with the provider side)."

#: flowing.model:77 of
msgid "``FLOWING_MODELS_PATH`` —— 重定向 ``models.yaml``。"
msgstr "``FLOWING_MODELS_PATH`` — redirect ``models.yaml``."

#: flowing.model:78 of
msgid "``FLOWING_MODEL_TAGS`` —— 最优先的标签映射文件（级联保留，非完全 重定向）。"
msgstr "``FLOWING_MODEL_TAGS`` — the highest-priority tag mapping file (cascading retained, not a full redirect)."

#: flowing.model:83 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.providers`"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.providers`"

#: flowing.model:84 of
msgid "Provider 侧契约：adapter 继承树、providers.yaml、注册与懒实例化、 异常分类与安全边界。"
msgstr "Provider-side contract: adapter inheritance tree, providers.yaml, registration and lazy instantiation, exception classification and security boundaries."

#: flowing.model:87 of
msgid "``self.model`` / ``self.model_tag`` 的持有者，``provider_gen()`` 双模式与当场解析的调用方。"
msgstr "Holder of ``self.model`` / ``self.model_tag``; caller of ``provider_gen()``'s dual modes and on-the-spot resolution."

#: flowing.model:89 flowing.params:81 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.parsable`"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.parsable`"

#: flowing.model:90 of
msgid "``ModelConfig`` 字段级求值依赖的 Parsable 机制。"
msgstr "The Parsable mechanism that ``ModelConfig`` field-level evaluation depends on."

#: flowing.model:91 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.runtime.Runtime`"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.runtime.Runtime`"

#: flowing.model:92 of
msgid "``set_model_tags()`` 的宿主。"
msgstr "Host of ``set_model_tags()``."

#: flowing.model.load_models:1 of
msgid "读 ``models.yaml`` 构建模型条目名 → ``ModelConfig`` 映射。"
msgstr "Read ``models.yaml`` to build a model entry name → ``ModelConfig`` mapping."

#: flowing.model.load_models:3 of
msgid ""
"字段分流在此发生：固定内建字段集（``model`` / ``provider`` / ``thinking_budget`` / "
"``context_window`` / ``max_output_tokens``）提升 为 ``ModelConfig`` "
"实例属性；条目中的其余字段进 ``_extra``，不参与 求值、不进 LLM 可见面。字符串字段值按 Parsable 判定：模板形态 "
"（``FILE_REF`` / ``EXPRESSION`` / ``TEMPLATE`` / ``RAW``）包装为 "
"Parsable，纯字面量保持静态原值。"
msgstr ""
"Field triage happens here: the fixed built-in field set (``model`` / ``provider`` / ``thinking_budget`` / "
"``context_window`` / ``max_output_tokens``) is promoted to ``ModelConfig`` "
"instance attributes; remaining fields in an entry go into ``_extra``, not participating in evaluation and not entering the LLM-visible surface. String field values are judged as Parsable: template-shaped values "
"(``FILE_REF`` / ``EXPRESSION`` / ``TEMPLATE`` / ``RAW``) are wrapped as "
"Parsable, while pure literals keep their static original values."

#: flowing.model.load_models:10 of
msgid ""
"与 :func:`load_model_tags` 同样保持纯“路径 → 映射”，不碰环境变量与 默认路径。``Runtime`` "
"启动期默认加载共用本入口（产物与 :func:`load_model_tags` 的产物 join 出“标签 → "
"``ModelConfig``”的最终 解析）。"
msgstr ""
"Like :func:`load_model_tags`, keeps pure \"path → mapping\" semantics and does not touch environment variables or default paths. The default load at "
"``Runtime`` startup shares this entry (its product is joined with :func:`load_model_tags`'s product into the final \"tag → "
"``ModelConfig``\" resolution)."

#: flowing.model.load_models:15 of
msgid "models.yaml 的已解析路径。"
msgstr "Resolved path of models.yaml."

#: flowing.model.load_models:16 of
msgid "模型条目名 → ``ModelConfig``。"
msgstr "Model entry name → ``ModelConfig``."

#: flowing.model.load_models:20 of
msgid ""
"每个条目必须含 ``model`` / ``provider`` 两个必填字段（缺失时 ``ModelConfig`` 构造报 "
"``TypeError``）。"
msgstr ""
"Each entry must contain the two required fields ``model`` / ``provider`` (missing ones cause ``ModelConfig`` construction to raise "
"``TypeError``)."

#: flowing.model.load_model_tags:19 flowing.model.load_models:22 of
msgid "文件不存在 → 原生 ``FileNotFoundError`` （不包装）。"
msgstr "File does not exist → native ``FileNotFoundError`` (not wrapped)."

#: flowing.model.load_models:24 of
msgid ""
":class:`ModelConfig` —— ``_extra`` 与分流语义； :func:`load_model_tags` —— "
"标签映射文件的对应解析器。"
msgstr ""
":class:`ModelConfig` — ``_extra`` and triage semantics; :func:`load_model_tags` — "
"the corresponding parser for the tag mapping file."

#: flowing.model.load_model_tags:1 of
msgid "读 ``model-tags.yaml`` 构建标签 → 模型条目名映射。"
msgstr "Read ``model-tags.yaml`` to build a tag → model entry name mapping."

#: flowing.model.load_model_tags:3 of
msgid ""
"标签映射文件解析器：产物是“标签 → 模型条目名”的纯字符串映射（单值 化——一个标签只映射一个模型条目名）。不产出 "
"``ModelConfig``——“标签 → 条目名 → ``ModelConfig``”的最后一跳是与 :func:`load_models` "
"产物的 join，由 ``Runtime`` 启动期默认加载与 ``runtime.set_model_tags(path)`` "
"登记后的现场求值完成。"
msgstr ""
"Parser for the tag mapping file: the product is a pure string mapping of \"tag → model entry name\" (single-valued — one tag maps to exactly one model "
"entry name). It does not produce ``ModelConfig`` — the last hop of \"tag → entry name → ``ModelConfig``\" is a join with :func:`load_models`' "
"product, done by the default load at ``Runtime`` startup and the on-the-spot evaluation after ``runtime.set_model_tags(path)`` "
"registration."

#: flowing.model.load_model_tags:9 of
msgid "与 :func:`load_models` 同样保持纯“路径 → 映射”，不碰环境变量与默认 路径。"
msgstr "Like :func:`load_models`, keeps pure \"path → mapping\" semantics and does not touch environment variables or default paths."

#: flowing.model.load_model_tags:12 of
msgid "model-tags.yaml 的已解析路径。"
msgstr "Resolved path of model-tags.yaml."

#: flowing.model.load_model_tags:13 of
msgid "模型标签 → 模型条目名。"
msgstr "Model tag → model entry name."

#: flowing.model.load_model_tags:17 of
msgid "文件顶层必须含 ``tags`` 映射键；缺失时抛 ``KeyError`` （fail-fast， 不静默回退）。"
msgstr "The file's top level must contain the ``tags`` mapping key; missing it raises ``KeyError`` (fail-fast, no silent fallback)."

#: flowing.model.load_model_tags:21 of
msgid ":func:`load_models` —— 模型条目文件的对应解析器。"
msgstr ":func:`load_models` — the corresponding parser for the model entry file."

#: ../../api/flowing.rst:89
msgid "flowing.params module"
msgstr "flowing.params module"

#: flowing.params:1 of
msgid "``flowing.params`` —— 参数声明（Pydantic 模型 / JSON Schema）与类型安全键。"
msgstr "``flowing.params`` — parameter declarations (Pydantic models / JSON Schema) and type-safe keys."

#: flowing.params:5 of
msgid ""
"本模块承载工具与子 Agent 的参数声明基础设施，以及两个与参数声明无关 的类型安全键（:class:`InjectionKey` / "
":class:`ConfigKey`）。参数声明有 两种同构形态，由同一份声明派生出 LLM 可见的 JSON Schema 与执行层校验 "
"模型，没有需要独立维护的第二份声明："
msgstr ""
"This module carries the parameter declaration infrastructure for tools and sub-agents, plus two type-safe keys unrelated to parameter declaration "
"(:class:`InjectionKey` / :class:`ConfigKey`). Parameter declarations have two isomorphic forms; the LLM-visible JSON Schema and the execution-layer "
"validation model are both derived from the same declaration — there is no second declaration to maintain independently:"

#: flowing.params:10 of
msgid ""
"Python 层：Pydantic ``BaseModel`` 子类——手写工具 / Agent 子类的 声明方式。LLM 可见 schema 由"
" ``model_json_schema()`` 派生，执行层 校验即模型本身（``model_validate``）；"
msgstr ""
"Python layer: Pydantic ``BaseModel`` subclasses — the declaration form for hand-written tools / Agent subclasses. The LLM-visible schema is derived "
"from ``model_json_schema()``, and execution-layer validation is the model itself (``model_validate``);"

#: flowing.params:13 of
msgid ""
"fya 层：``args:`` 块的展开式 JSON Schema——装配期经 :func:`schema_to_model` 桥接为等价 "
"Pydantic 模型。"
msgstr ""
"fya layer: the expanded JSON Schema of the ``args:`` block — bridged into an equivalent "
"Pydantic model at assembly time via :func:`schema_to_model`."

#: flowing.params:16 of
msgid ""
"fya 声明层（``args:`` 块）的书写规则：逐参数展开，无 ``type: object`` 顶层包装、无 ``required:`` "
"清单——必填性由 ``default`` 有无派生（无 ``default`` → 必填，与 Pydantic“无默认值字段必填”语义同构）::"
msgstr ""
"Writing rules for the fya declaration layer (``args:`` block): expand parameter by parameter, with no ``type: object`` top-level wrapper and no "
"``required:`` list — requiredness is derived from the presence of ``default`` (no ``default`` → required, isomorphic to Pydantic's \"fields without defaults are required\" semantics)::"

#: flowing.params:27 of
msgid "两种简写糖（:func:`expand_args_schema` 归一化，声明端专用；覆写端零糖）："
msgstr "Two shorthand sugars (normalized by :func:`expand_args_schema`, declaration-side only; zero sugar on the override side):"

#: flowing.params:29 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"裸类型字符串：``str`` / ``int`` / ``float`` / ``bool`` / ``list`` / ``dict`` → "
"对应 ``{type: ...}`` 单键 property（必填）；"
msgstr ""
"Bare type strings: ``str`` / ``int`` / ``float`` / ``bool`` / ``list`` / ``dict`` → "
"the corresponding single-key ``{type: ...}`` property (required);"

#: flowing.params:31 of
msgid "YAML 字面量：标量 / 列表字面量 → 按值类型推断 ``type`` 并以值为 ``default`` （可选）。"
msgstr "YAML literals: scalar / list literals → ``type`` inferred from the value type, with the value as ``default`` (optional)."

#: flowing.params:34 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"其余值一律是完整 JSON Schema property dict（``{}`` 合法，表示匹配一切 的 any 类型）。``type:`` "
"的取值同时识别 Python 风格简写名与 JSON Schema 名（``type: str`` ≡ ``type: string``，别名表 "
":data:`TYPE_ALIASES`），并 支持类型表达式：联合（``str | None``）与泛型嵌套（``list[str]`` / "
"``dict[str, int]``）可组合。可空参数写标准 nullable 形态 ``{type: [string, \"null\"], "
"default: null}`` （Pydantic 侧对应 ``str | None = None``）。"
msgstr ""
"All other values are complete JSON Schema property dicts (``{}`` is legal, meaning the any type that matches everything). ``type:`` "
"values recognize both Python-style shorthand names and JSON Schema names (``type: str`` ≡ ``type: string``, alias table "
":data:`TYPE_ALIASES`), and support type expressions: unions (``str | None``) and generic nesting (``list[str]`` / "
"``dict[str, int]``) compose. Nullable parameters are written in the standard nullable form ``{type: [string, \"null\"], "
"default: null}`` (corresponding to ``str | None = None`` on the Pydantic side)."

#: flowing.params:42 of
msgid ""
"桥接（:func:`schema_to_model`）认识的 JSON Schema 关键字子集：``type`` / "
"``description`` / ``default`` / ``enum`` / ``minimum`` / ``maximum`` / "
"``minLength`` / ``maxLength`` / ``pattern`` / ``items`` / ``properties`` "
"——逐关键字映射为 Pydantic 字段约束；超出子集（``oneOf`` / ``anyOf`` / ``$ref`` / ``allOf``"
" 等组合子）在装配期抛 :class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` （fail-fast：出错即刻抛异常、不静默 "
"降级）。"
msgstr ""
"The subset of JSON Schema keywords known to bridging (:func:`schema_to_model`): ``type`` / "
"``description`` / ``default`` / ``enum`` / ``minimum`` / ``maximum`` / "
"``minLength`` / ``maxLength`` / ``pattern`` / ``items`` / ``properties`` "
"— mapped keyword by keyword into Pydantic field constraints; anything beyond the subset (``oneOf`` / ``anyOf`` / ``$ref`` / ``allOf`` "
"and other combinators) raises :class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` at assembly time (fail-fast: raise immediately on error, no silent "
"degradation)."

#: flowing.params:50 of
msgid ""
"覆写（:func:`apply_param_overrides`）供绑定层（``ToolEntry`` / ``SubagentEntry``）的"
" ``override_params`` 使用：对基底 JSON Schema properties "
"做稀疏深合并，只写要改的参数与关键字；覆写端零语法糖（类型 必须写 ``type:`` 关键字），未知关键字抛 "
"``FormatError``，未提及的 关键字原样沿用基底，未知参数名视为新增参数。"
msgstr ""
"Overriding (:func:`apply_param_overrides`) serves the binding layer's (``ToolEntry`` / ``SubagentEntry``) "
"``override_params``: it does a sparse deep merge over the base JSON Schema properties — write only the parameters and keywords to change; "
"the override side has zero syntactic sugar (types must be written with the ``type:`` keyword); unknown keywords raise "
"``FormatError``; unmentioned keywords keep the base as-is; unknown parameter names are treated as new parameters."

#: flowing.params:56 of
msgid ""
"安全边界：``args`` / ``parameters`` 最终序列化为 JSON 经 function calling 传给 "
"LLM，因此只接受 JSON 兼容值（``str`` / ``int`` / ``float`` / ``bool`` 标量及其 ``list``"
" / ``dict`` 嵌套组合）。复杂对象（数据库连接、 服务客户端、函数、生成器）不允许走参数声明；``specified`` 也不是复杂 "
"对象通道——它只是为 LLM 不可见的标量参数提供值（固定值或注入表达式）。 复杂对象的两条替代路径："
msgstr ""
"Security boundary: ``args`` / ``parameters`` are ultimately serialized to JSON and passed to the LLM via function calling, so only JSON-compatible "
"values are accepted (``str`` / ``int`` / ``float`` / ``bool`` scalars and their ``list`` "
"/ ``dict`` nested combinations). Complex objects (database connections, service clients, functions, generators) are not allowed in parameter declarations; ``specified`` is not a complex-object "
"channel either — it only provides values (fixed values or injection expressions) for scalar parameters invisible to the LLM. Two alternative paths for complex objects:"

#: flowing.params:63 of
msgid "传可序列化标识符（``connection_id: \"main\"``），工具内部按标识符查找；"
msgstr "Pass a serializable identifier (``connection_id: \"main\"``), and the tool looks it up internally by identifier;"

#: flowing.params:64 of
msgid "``execute()`` 声明 ``caller`` 参数，从调用方 Agent 实例上取对象。"
msgstr "``execute()`` declares a ``caller`` parameter and gets the object from the calling Agent instance."

#: flowing.params:66 of
msgid ""
"类型安全键：:class:`InjectionKey` 与 :class:`ConfigKey` 是两个仅在调用 侧生效的泛型类型安全键：泛型参数"
" ``T`` 只提供编译期类型标注，运行期 完全退化为按 ``name`` 的字符串匹配（注入存储的 key 恒为 ``str``），框架 "
"不做运行期类型校验。因此类型不匹配（亲节点 provide 了 ``int``、子按 ``InjectionKey[str]`` "
"inject）不会被框架拦截——需要运行期校验的场景走 参数声明（Pydantic 模型校验），而非 provide / inject。"
msgstr ""
"Type-safe keys: :class:`InjectionKey` and :class:`ConfigKey` are two generic type-safe keys that only take effect on the call side: the generic "
"parameter ``T`` only provides compile-time type annotation and fully degenerates at runtime to string matching by ``name`` (injection store keys are always ``str``); the framework "
"does no runtime type checking. Therefore type mismatches (a parent provided an ``int``, a child injects with ``InjectionKey[str]``) "
"are not intercepted by the framework — scenarios needing runtime validation go through parameter declaration (Pydantic model validation), not provide / inject."

#: flowing.params:73 of
msgid ""
"本模块的公开面为下列符号：常量 ``ARG_SHORTHAND`` / ``TYPE_ALIASES`` / "
"``SCHEMA_KEYWORDS``，函数 ``expand_args_schema`` / ``schema_to_model`` / "
"``apply_param_overrides``，类 :class:`InjectionKey` / :class:`ConfigKey` "
"——属跨版本稳定契约；其余符号（类型变量 ``T`` 与下划线前缀符号）为内部 实现。"
msgstr ""
"The module's public surface consists of the following symbols: constants ``ARG_SHORTHAND`` / ``TYPE_ALIASES`` / "
"``SCHEMA_KEYWORDS``, functions ``expand_args_schema`` / ``schema_to_model`` / "
"``apply_param_overrides``, classes :class:`InjectionKey` / :class:`ConfigKey` "
"— part of the cross-version stable contract; the remaining symbols (type variable ``T`` and underscore-prefixed symbols) are internal implementation."

#: flowing.params:82 of
msgid "Parsable 惰性求值、渲染上下文与 ``PENDING`` 哨兵的定义模块。"
msgstr "The module defining Parsable lazy evaluation, render context, and the ``PENDING`` sentinel."

#: flowing.params:84 of
msgid "``args_model`` 的宿主。"
msgstr "Host of ``args_model``."

#: flowing.params:85 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.tool.ToolDefinition`、:class:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry`"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.tool.ToolDefinition`, :class:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry`"

#: flowing.params:86 of
msgid "Tool 侧参数声明与 ``specified`` 聚合的消费者。"
msgstr "Consumer of Tool-side parameter declarations and ``specified`` aggregation."

#: flowing.params:88 of
msgid "``ConfigKey`` 的消费入口。"
msgstr "Consumption entry of ``ConfigKey``."

#: flowing.params:89 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.runtime.inject_from`"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.runtime.inject_from`"

#: flowing.params:90 of
msgid "``InjectionKey`` 跨节点退化为按 ``name`` 匹配的执行点。"
msgstr "The execution point where ``InjectionKey`` degenerates to by-``name`` matching across nodes."

#: flowing.params.ARG_SHORTHAND:1 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"裸类型字符串简写表（``str`` → ``\"string\"`` 等）：fya ``args:`` 声明 块里写 ``category: "
"str`` 时按本表展开为 ``{type: \"string\"}``。声明端 专用——覆写端（Entry 补丁）不做任何糖，类型必须写 "
"``type:`` 关键字。"
msgstr ""
"Bare type string shorthand table (``str`` → ``\"string\"`` etc.): writing ``category: "
"str`` in an fya ``args:`` declaration block expands to ``{type: \"string\"}`` per this table. Declaration-side "
"only — the override side (Entry patches) applies no sugar at all; types must be written with the "
"``type:`` keyword."

#: flowing.params.TYPE_ALIASES:1 of
msgid ""
"``type:`` 关键字取值的别名表：Python 风格简写名（``str`` / ``int`` / ``float`` / ``bool``"
" / ``list`` / ``dict``）与 JSON Schema 名 （``string`` / ``integer`` / "
"...）等价。声明端与覆写端均识别，桥接 （:func:`schema_to_model`）统一归一为 JSON Schema 名。"
msgstr ""
"Alias table for ``type:`` keyword values: Python-style shorthand names (``str`` / ``int`` / ``float`` / ``bool`` "
"/ ``list`` / ``dict``) are equivalent to JSON Schema names (``string`` / ``integer`` / "
"...). Recognized on both the declaration and override sides; bridging (:func:`schema_to_model`) uniformly normalizes them to JSON Schema names."

#: flowing.params.SCHEMA_KEYWORDS:1 of
msgid ""
"桥接子集关键字集合：:func:`schema_to_model` 认识的 JSON Schema 关键字。property "
"中出现子集之外的关键字（``oneOf`` / ``anyOf`` / ``$ref`` / ``allOf`` 等）→ 桥接期 "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError`。"
msgstr ""
"Bridging-subset keyword set: the JSON Schema keywords known to :func:`schema_to_model`. Keywords outside the subset appearing in a property "
"(``oneOf`` / ``anyOf`` / ``$ref`` / ``allOf`` etc.) → :class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` at bridge time."

#: flowing.params.bridge_properties:1 of
msgid "把 JSON Schema ``properties`` 收敛到桥接子集（内部 API，声明即模型侧用）。"
msgstr "Converge JSON Schema ``properties`` to the bridging subset (internal API, used by the declare-as-model side)."

#: flowing.params.bridge_properties:5 of
msgid ""
"从 pydantic ``model_json_schema()`` 等**机器派生**的 property 表收敛为 桥接子集成员——丢弃 "
"``title`` 等纯展示键，保留 ``SCHEMA_KEYWORDS`` 内关键字原值。调用点是框架内部把“模型 → "
"params_schema”的转换处 （``ScriptTool.__init__`` 等）；**手写** .fya ``args:`` "
"与覆写体不走本 函数，超子集键仍由 :func:`schema_to_model` fail-fast（用户笔误要报错， "
"机器噪音要滤掉，两通道分开）。"
msgstr ""
"Converges a **machine-derived** property table (from pydantic ``model_json_schema()`` etc.) into bridging-subset members — drops "
"pure display keys like ``title`` and keeps the original values of keywords within ``SCHEMA_KEYWORDS``. Call sites are where the framework internally converts "
"\"model → params_schema\" (``ScriptTool.__init__`` etc.); **hand-written** .fya ``args:`` "
"and override bodies do not go through this function — out-of-subset keys there still fail-fast in :func:`schema_to_model` (user typos must be reported, "
"machine noise must be filtered; the two channels are kept separate)."

#: flowing.params.bridge_properties:14 of
msgid "只滤键、不改值；输入不被修改（返回新 dict）。"
msgstr "Only filters keys, never modifies values; the input is not modified (a new dict is returned)."

#: flowing.params.bridge_properties:15 of
msgid "子集外关键字（``title`` 等）直接丢弃——它们是 pydantic/工具链的 展示元数据，对桥接无意义。"
msgstr "Out-of-subset keywords (``title`` etc.) are dropped directly — they are display metadata of pydantic/toolchains and meaningless for bridging."

#: flowing.params.bridge_properties:17 of
msgid "值非 dict 的畸形 property 原样透传（错误留给下游判别）。"
msgstr "Malformed properties whose value is not a dict pass through as-is (the error is left for downstream judgment)."

#: flowing.params.bridge_properties:19 of
msgid ":data:`SCHEMA_KEYWORDS`、:func:`schema_to_model`。"
msgstr ":data:`SCHEMA_KEYWORDS`, :func:`schema_to_model`."

#: flowing.params.expand_args_schema:1 of
msgid "把 fya ``args:`` 声明块归一化为 JSON Schema properties（展开两种简写糖）。"
msgstr "Normalize an fya ``args:`` declaration block into JSON Schema properties (expanding the two shorthand sugars)."

#: flowing.params.expand_args_schema:5 of
msgid "声明端唯一的糖处理点，逐参数按固定顺序判别："
msgstr "The declaration side's only sugar processing point, judging parameter by parameter in a fixed order:"

#: flowing.params.expand_args_schema:7 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "值是裸类型字符串（:data:`ARG_SHORTHAND` 六个保留字之一）→ ``{type: <展开值>}`` （必填）；"
msgstr "Value is a bare type string (one of :data:`ARG_SHORTHAND`'s six reserved words) → ``{type: <expanded value>}`` (required);"

#: flowing.params.expand_args_schema:9 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"值是 dict → 原样作为完整 JSON Schema property（``{}`` 合法， any 语义；键超出 "
":data:`SCHEMA_KEYWORDS` 子集的报错推迟到 :func:`schema_to_model` 桥接时）；"
msgstr ""
"Value is a dict → taken as-is as a complete JSON Schema property (``{}`` is legal, any semantics; errors for keys outside the "
":data:`SCHEMA_KEYWORDS` subset are deferred until bridging in :func:`schema_to_model`);"

#: flowing.params.expand_args_schema:12 of
msgid ""
"值是其余 YAML 字面量（标量 / 列表）→ 按值类型推断 ``type`` 并 以值为 ``default`` （可选）；值是 "
"``None`` （YAML ``key:`` 空值） → :class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` "
"（连声明意图都无法确认， fail-fast）。"
msgstr ""
"Value is any other YAML literal (scalar / list) → ``type`` inferred from the value type with the value as ``default`` (optional); value is "
"``None`` (YAML ``key:`` empty value) → :class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` "
"(even the declaration intent cannot be confirmed — fail-fast)."

#: flowing.params.expand_args_schema:17 of
msgid ""
"归一化产物不含 required 信息——必填性恒由 property 的 ``default`` 有无派生（无 ``default`` → "
"必填）。"
msgstr ""
"The normalized product contains no required information — requiredness is always derived from the presence of the property's ``default`` "
"(no ``default`` → required)."

#: flowing.params.expand_args_schema:20 of
msgid "fya ``args:`` 块的原始映射（参数名 → 值）。"
msgstr "The raw mapping of an fya ``args:`` block (parameter name → value)."

#: flowing.params.expand_args_schema:21 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``{参数名: property dict}``，新构造的 dict（输入不被修改）。"
msgstr "``{parameter_name: property dict}``, a newly constructed dict (input not modified)."

#: flowing.params.expand_args_schema:22 of
msgid "某参数值为 ``None`` （空声明）时。"
msgstr "When some parameter's value is ``None`` (empty declaration)."

#: flowing.params.expand_args_schema:24 of
msgid ":func:`schema_to_model` —— 下一步桥接。"
msgstr ":func:`schema_to_model` — the next bridging step."

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:1 of
msgid "把 JSON Schema properties 桥接为 Pydantic 模型（基础子集，fail-fast）。"
msgstr "Bridge JSON Schema properties into a Pydantic model (basic subset, fail-fast)."

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:5 of
msgid ""
"fya 声明（经 :func:`expand_args_schema` 归一化）与 Entry 补丁后的 最终 schema "
"共用同一个建模入口（经 ``pydantic.create_model`` 动态 建模）。逐 property 映射："
msgstr ""
"fya declarations (normalized via :func:`expand_args_schema`) and the final schema after Entry patches share the same "
"modeling entry (dynamic modeling via ``pydantic.create_model``). Per-property mapping:"

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:9 of
msgid ""
"``type`` → Python 类型（``string``→``str``、``integer``→``int``、 "
"``number``→``float``、``boolean``→``bool``、``array``→``list``、 "
"``object``→``dict``；``[T, \"null\"]`` 可空形态 → ``T | None``）； 取值先经 "
":data:`TYPE_ALIASES` 归一（``type: str`` ≡ ``type: string``）；含 ``|`` "
"或方括号的复合类型表达式（如 ``str | None``、``list[str]``）经 :func:`_parse_type_expr` "
"展开；"
msgstr ""
"``type`` → Python type (``string``→``str``, ``integer``→``int``, "
"``number``→``float``, ``boolean``→``bool``, ``array``→``list``, "
"``object``→``dict``; the ``[T, \"null\"]`` nullable form → ``T | None``); values are first normalized via "
":data:`TYPE_ALIASES` (``type: str`` ≡ ``type: string``); composite type expressions containing ``|`` "
"or brackets (e.g. ``str | None``, ``list[str]``) are expanded via :func:`_parse_type_expr`;"

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:15 of
msgid ""
"约束关键字 → ``pydantic.Field`` 约束（``minimum``→``ge``、 "
"``maximum``→``le``、``minLength``→``min_length``、 "
"``maxLength``→``max_length``、``pattern`` 同名）； ``description`` → "
"``Field(description=...)``；``enum`` → ``Literal``；"
msgstr ""
"constraint keywords → ``pydantic.Field`` constraints (``minimum``→``ge``, "
"``maximum``→``le``, ``minLength``→``min_length``, "
"``maxLength``→``max_length``, ``pattern`` same-named); ``description`` → "
"``Field(description=...)``; ``enum`` → ``Literal``;"

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:19 of
msgid "必填性派生：property 无 ``default`` → 必填字段；有 → 以 ``default`` 为字段默认值。"
msgstr "Requiredness derivation: property without ``default`` → required field; with → ``default`` becomes the field default."

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:22 of
msgid "生成的模型类名。"
msgstr "Name of the generated model class."

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:23 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``{参数名: JSON Schema property dict}``。"
msgstr "``{parameter_name: JSON Schema property dict}``."

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:24 of
msgid "新的 Pydantic 模型类。"
msgstr "A new Pydantic model class."

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:26 of
msgid "property 含超出 :data:`SCHEMA_KEYWORDS` 子集的关键字时（报错信息列出参数名与 非法关键字）。"
msgstr "When a property contains keywords outside the :data:`SCHEMA_KEYWORDS` subset (the error message lists the parameter name and the illegal keyword)."

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:32 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``{}`` 空 property → 字段类型为 ``Any`` （匹配一切）。"
msgstr "``{}`` empty property → field type is ``Any`` (matches everything)."

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:33 of
msgid "``enum`` 与 ``default`` 共存合法（``default`` 须在 ``enum`` 内， 校验交 Pydantic）。"
msgstr "``enum`` coexisting with ``default`` is legal (``default`` must be within ``enum``; validation is left to Pydantic)."

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:35 of
msgid "返回新模型类，不修改入参；每次调用都创建新模型类，不缓存 （调用方可自行缓存）。"
msgstr "Returns a new model class without modifying the input; each call creates a new model class, no caching (callers may cache themselves)."

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:37 of
msgid "不做 JSON Schema 全量合规校验：只认上述子集，超子集 fail-fast。"
msgstr "No full JSON Schema compliance validation: only the above subset is recognized; anything beyond it fails fast."

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:38 of
msgid ""
"多成员非 null 联合（如 ``[string, integer]``）超出 Python 单类型 表达精度，桥接为 ``Any`` "
"（子集只承诺 ``[T, \"null\"]`` 可空形态）。"
msgstr ""
"Multi-member non-null unions (e.g. ``[string, integer]``) exceed Python single-type expression precision and are bridged to ``Any`` "
"(the subset only promises the ``[T, \"null\"]`` nullable form)."

#: flowing.params.schema_to_model:41 of
msgid ""
":func:`expand_args_schema` —— 前置归一化； :func:`apply_param_overrides` —— "
"补丁应用。"
msgstr ""
":func:`expand_args_schema` — the preceding normalization; :func:`apply_param_overrides` — "
"patch application."

#: flowing.params.apply_param_overrides:1 of
msgid "对 JSON Schema properties 应用稀疏补丁，产出新 dict（输入不变）。"
msgstr "Apply a sparse patch to JSON Schema properties, producing a new dict (input unchanged)."

#: flowing.params.apply_param_overrides:5 of
msgid ""
"绑定层（``ToolEntry`` / ``SubagentEntry``）覆写参数声明的唯一应用 点：``override_params`` "
"是基底 schema 的稀疏镜像——只写要改的参数、 只写要改的关键字，未提及的从基底深合并回填。``ToolDefinition`` 的 LLM"
" 视图生成与子 Agent catalog 的 ``<params>`` 生成共用本函数。"
msgstr ""
"The sole application point for the binding layer (``ToolEntry`` / ``SubagentEntry``) to override parameter declarations: ``override_params`` "
"is a sparse mirror of the base schema — write only the parameters to change, write only the keywords to change; unmentioned parts are backfilled from the base "
"via deep merge. ``ToolDefinition``'s LLM view generation and sub-agent catalog ``<params>`` generation both share this function."

#: flowing.params.apply_param_overrides:10 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "基底 ``{参数名: JSON Schema property dict}``。"
msgstr "Base ``{parameter_name: JSON Schema property dict}``."

#: flowing.params.apply_param_overrides:11 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "补丁 ``{参数名: {JSON Schema 关键字: 值}}``。"
msgstr "Patch ``{parameter_name: {JSON Schema keyword: value}}``."

#: flowing.params.apply_param_overrides:12 of
msgid "合并后的新 dict；基底及其 property dict 不被修改。"
msgstr "The merged new dict; the base and its property dicts are not modified."

#: flowing.params.apply_param_overrides:14 of
msgid "补丁含超出 :data:`SCHEMA_KEYWORDS` 子集的关键字时（fail-fast）。"
msgstr "When the patch contains keywords outside the :data:`SCHEMA_KEYWORDS` subset (fail-fast)."

#: flowing.params.apply_param_overrides:19 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"零语法糖：补丁子字段一律是 JSON Schema 关键字，类型必须写 ``type:``；覆写端不做裸类型字符串 / "
"字面量推断——裸值在覆写语境 由解析层归入 specified（指定值），到不了本函数。注意陷阱：覆写端 写 ``id: str`` "
"不会展开为类型声明，而是得到指定值字符串 ``\"str\"`` ——想改类型必须写 ``id: {type: string}``。"
msgstr ""
"Zero syntactic sugar: patch subfields are always JSON Schema keywords, and types must be written with ``type:``; the override side does no bare-type-string / "
"literal inference — bare values in the override context are classified by the parsing layer into specified (specified values) and never reach this function. "
"Note the pitfall: writing ``id: str`` on the override side does not expand into a type declaration but yields the specified value string ``\"str\"`` "
"— to change the type you must write ``id: {type: string}``."

#: flowing.params.apply_param_overrides:24 of
