msgstr ""
"Unknown parameter names: keys appearing in ``overrides`` but not in ``params_schema`` → treated as new parameters (the patch property "
"is merged directly) — the Tool side's ``FinishTool`` dynamic schema depends on this semantics."

#: flowing.params.apply_param_overrides:43 of
msgid ""
":func:`schema_to_model` —— 补丁后最终 schema 的建模 "
