"specified 参数隐藏）。"
msgstr ""
":func:`schema_to_model` — modeling bridge of the post-patch final schema; "
":class:`flowing.tool.ToolDefinition` — Tool-side wrapper (also covering alias / description / "
"specified parameter hiding)."

#: ../../api/flowing.rst:97
msgid "flowing.parsable module"
msgstr "flowing.parsable module"

#: flowing.parsable:1 of
msgid "``flowing.parsable`` —— Parsable 统一抽象、惰性求值与双哨兵。"
msgstr "``flowing.parsable`` — the unified Parsable abstraction, lazy evaluation, and dual sentinels."

#: flowing.parsable:5 of
msgid ""
"本模块是 ``.fya`` 文件层与运行时对象模型之间的桥梁：``.fya`` 中所有 "
"“可解析字段”（``system_prompt``、``description`` 及各类具名块的内容） 在解析后统一表示为 "
":class:`Parsable`，运行时在使用方决定的时机现场求值。 本模块同时承载两个模块级单例哨兵：:data:`PENDING` "
"（延迟定义承诺）与 ``_UNSET`` （未设置）。"
msgstr ""
"This module is the bridge between the ``.fya`` file layer and the runtime object model: all "
"\"parsable fields\" in ``.fya`` (``system_prompt``, ``description``, and the contents of various named blocks) are uniformly represented as "
":class:`Parsable` after parsing, and are evaluated on the spot at runtime at a time decided by the consumer. This module also hosts two module-level singleton sentinels: :data:`PENDING` "
"(deferred-definition promise) and ``_UNSET`` (not set)."

#: flowing.parsable:11 of
msgid ""
"本模块只定义“存储求值指令 + 现场求值”的机制，不定义任何使用方的求值 策略（何时求值、用什么上下文）——求值时机由各使用方各自决定，见下文 "
"“各使用方求值时机”表。"
msgstr ""
"This module only defines the mechanism of \"store evaluation instructions + evaluate on the spot\", not any consumer's evaluation policy (when to "
"evaluate, with what context) — evaluation timing is decided by each consumer individually; see the \"Per-Consumer Evaluation Timing\" table below."

