msgstr ""
"YAML quoting constraint: double-brace expressions in ``.fya`` must be written inside quotes (``max_turns: \"{{ "
"config.limits.turns }}\"``) — ``{`` is a YAML flow-mapping start character and unquoted use errors directly at the YAML "
"layer. Multi-line content can instead use YAML block scalars (starting with ``system_prompt: |``) to avoid quotes."

