#: flowing.parsable:107 of
msgid ""
"路径解析是字符串前缀判断，不引入专门的路径类型：``./`` = 当前文件所在 目录，``../`` = 上级目录，``@/`` = 项目根，多级"
" ``../../`` 按层级向上。 前缀集合的唯一权威表是 :data:`flowing.paths.PATH_PREFIXES`；实际解析 "
"委托 ``Runtime.resolve_path(path, *, source_dir)``，``source_dir`` 基准 由 "
"``Agent.source_dir`` 统一供给。裸名（如 ``payment``）不是路径形态， "
"但在资源查找口径下可以命中当前目录。判定规则： ``ToolRegistry.get`` 在 ``source_dir`` "
"可用时先走文件链，当前目录下的 同名文件覆盖 ``default::`` / ``builtin::`` 注册项；``source_dir`` "
"缺省时只查注册表。形态判别见 :func:`flowing.paths.classify_ref`。"
msgstr ""
"Path resolution is string-prefix judgment and introduces no dedicated path type: ``./`` = the current file's directory, ``../`` = the parent directory, ``@/`` = the project root, multi-level "
"``../../`` walks up level by level. The sole authoritative table of the prefix set is :data:`flowing.paths.PATH_PREFIXES`; actual resolution "
"is delegated to ``Runtime.resolve_path(path, *, source_dir)``, with the ``source_dir`` base uniformly supplied by "
"``Agent.source_dir``. A bare name (e.g. ``payment``) is not a path shape, "
"but can hit the current directory under resource-lookup semantics. The judgment rule: when ``source_dir`` is available, ``ToolRegistry.get`` "
"tries the file chain first, and a same-named file in the current directory overrides ``default::`` / ``builtin::`` registry entries; when ``source_dir`` "
"is absent, only the registry is consulted. Shape discrimination is in :func:`flowing.paths.classify_ref`."

