#: flowing.parsable:225 of
msgid "``_extra`` 中的任意字段"
msgstr "Arbitrary fields in ``_extra``"

#: flowing.parsable:226 of
msgid "框架不自动 resolve——由声明该字段的插件在 ``use_xxx()`` 中接管"
msgstr "Not auto-resolved by the framework — taken over by the plugin that declared the field in ``use_xxx()``"

#: flowing.parsable:229 of
msgid "插件自定义可解析字段"
msgstr "Plugin-defined custom parsable fields"

#: flowing.parsable:230 of
msgid ""
"``.fya`` 解析时默认构造为 ``Parsable`` 的字段集合由框架核心固定（即上表 “求值面内”字段，外加宿主显式声明 "
"Parsable 承载的字段）。除此之外的 可解析对象由插件 / 组件自行定义："
msgstr ""
"The set of fields constructed as ``Parsable`` by default during ``.fya`` parsing is fixed by the framework core (the \"in evaluation surface\" fields "
"in the table above, plus fields whose host explicitly declares Parsable carrying). Parsable objects beyond that are defined by plugins / components themselves:"

#: flowing.parsable:234 of
msgid ""
"插件自行决定自己的哪些字段是可解析的，并以对开发者的约定形式写进 插件文档（“本插件的 X 字段是 Parsable”是插件契约的一部分，框架不 "
"提供通用注册表）。"
msgstr ""
"The plugin itself decides which of its fields are parsable, and writes that into the plugin documentation as a convention for developers (\"this "
"plugin's X field is Parsable\" is part of the plugin contract; the framework provides no general registry)."

#: flowing.parsable:237 of
msgid ""
"机制：在 ``use_xxx()`` 启用钩子里，插件把对应变量重赋值为“由该变量 的 ``.fya`` 解析结果创建的 "
":class:`Parsable` 对象”——框架解析层不为 插件字段自动包装，包装动作显式发生在启用时。"
msgstr ""
"Mechanism: in the ``use_xxx()`` install hook, the plugin reassigns the corresponding variable to \"a :class:`Parsable` object created from that "
"variable's ``.fya`` parse result\" — the framework parsing layer does not auto-wrap plugin fields; the wrapping action happens explicitly at install time."

#: flowing.parsable:240 of
msgid ""
"求值同样由插件负责：重赋值后的 Parsable 由插件在需要时手动 ``resolve(context)`` （见下“求值面内 vs "
"求值面外”）。"
msgstr ""
"Evaluation is likewise the plugin's responsibility: the reassigned Parsable is manually ``resolve(context)``ed by the plugin when needed (see "
"\"In vs Out of the Evaluation Surface\" below)."

#: flowing.parsable:244 of
msgid "求值面内 vs 求值面外"
msgstr "In vs out of the evaluation surface"

#: flowing.parsable:245 of
msgid "示意图（无行列语义）："
msgstr "Schematic (no row/column semantics):"

#: flowing.parsable:261 of
msgid ""
"框架不为 Parsable 做隐式解包（类比 Vue 的 ref 但刻意不自动拆箱）： 隐式解包会掩盖求值开销，且求值上下文未必总是 "
"``self``。判断标准：字段 是否在上表“求值面内”；面外字段拿到的永远是 :class:`Parsable` 对象。"
msgstr ""
"The framework does no implicit unwrapping for Parsable (analogous to Vue's ref but deliberately without auto-unboxing): implicit unwrapping would hide "
"evaluation cost, and the evaluation context is not necessarily always ``self``. Judgment criterion: whether the field is \"in the evaluation surface\" in the table above; out-of-surface fields always receive a :class:`Parsable` object."

#: flowing.parsable:267 of
msgid "不缓存求值结果、不缓存文件内容、不缓存渲染输出；每次 resolve 现场 执行。"
msgstr "No caching of evaluation results, file contents, or render output; every resolve executes on the spot."

#: flowing.parsable:269 of
msgid "不递归展开被引用文件中的 ``$path``。"
msgstr "No recursive expansion of ``$path`` inside referenced files."

#: flowing.parsable:270 of
msgid ""
"不提供响应式重算：``watch(name, handler)`` 只监听属性赋值事件，不 监听解析值的逻辑变化（``self.c = "
"Parsable(\"{{ a == b }}\")`` 之后修改 ``self.a``，``watch(\"c\")`` 不触发——因为 "
"``self.c`` 从未被重新赋值）。 要“a 变导致 c 重算”，把 ``c`` 放进某个求值面让框架每次自动 resolve， 或自己 "
"``watch(\"a\")`` / ``watch(\"b\")`` 在 handler 中给 ``self.c`` 直接赋值。"
msgstr ""
"No reactive recomputation: ``watch(name, handler)`` only listens to attribute assignment events, not logical changes of resolved values (after "
"``self.c = Parsable(\"{{ a == b }}\")``, modifying ``self.a`` does not trigger ``watch(\"c\")`` — because "
"``self.c`` was never reassigned). To get \"a changing causes c to recompute\", put ``c`` into some evaluation surface so the framework auto-resolves it each time, or "
"``watch(\"a\")`` / ``watch(\"b\")`` yourself and assign ``self.c`` directly in the handler."

#: flowing.parsable:276 of
msgid "不监听运行期文件变更（无文件系统 watcher）：``FILE_REF`` 的“文件 修改后下次求值反映新内容”仅指进程内再次求值。"
msgstr "No runtime file-change watching (no filesystem watcher): ``FILE_REF``'s \"file modifications reflected at next evaluation\" only means re-evaluation within the process."

#: flowing.parsable:278 of
msgid ""
"双哨兵不混用：:data:`PENDING` （延迟定义承诺，``.fya`` 中 ``field: _`` 的解析结果）与 ``_UNSET``"
" （未设置，现仅用于 ``Agent.source_file`` 的自动推算触发条件）语义不同、不可混用。 ``PENDING`` "
"等待的是用户代码赋值；``_UNSET`` 表示“该位置从无默认 / 显式值”。创建管线 ``setup()`` "
"返回后、``after_create`` 前检查仍为 ``PENDING`` 的字段，抛 ``MissingFieldError``。"
msgstr ""
"The dual sentinels must not be mixed: :data:`PENDING` (deferred-definition promise, the parse result of ``field: _`` in ``.fya``) and ``_UNSET`` "
"(not set, currently used only as the trigger condition for ``Agent.source_file`` auto-inference) have different semantics and must not be mixed. ``PENDING`` "
"waits for user-code assignment; ``_UNSET`` means \"this position never had a default / explicit value\". Fields still ``PENDING`` after the "
"creation pipeline's ``setup()`` returns and before ``after_create`` raise ``MissingFieldError``."

#: flowing.parsable:284 of
msgid ""
"稳定性分级：本模块全部公开签名（:class:`Parsable` 及其公开方法、 "
"五个形式常量、:data:`PENDING`）属于跨版本稳定契约；``_`` 前缀符号为 内部 API，不属稳定契约。"
msgstr ""
"Stability grading: all public signatures of this module (:class:`Parsable` and its public methods, "
"the five form constants, :data:`PENDING`) belong to the cross-version stable contract; ``_``-prefixed symbols are internal API, not part of the stable contract."

#: flowing.parsable:291 of
msgid "Parsable 的主要宿主；``Agent.parsable()`` 工厂方法与 ``Agent.watch()`` 响应式边界。"
msgstr "Parsable's main host; the ``Agent.parsable()`` factory method and the ``Agent.watch()`` reactivity boundary."

#: flowing.parsable:293 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.errors`"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.errors`"

#: flowing.parsable:294 of
msgid ""
"``MissingContextError`` / ``MissingFieldError`` / "
"``ReservedAttributeError`` 的定义。"
msgstr ""
"Definitions of ``MissingContextError`` / ``MissingFieldError`` / "
"``ReservedAttributeError``."

#: flowing.parsable.LITERAL:1 of
msgid "字面量形式标记。"
msgstr "Literal form marker."

#: flowing.parsable.LITERAL:3 of
msgid ""
"``source`` 为普通字面量（``\"hello\"``、``123``、``true`` 等，且不命中 ``RAW`` / "
"``FILE_REF`` / ``EXPRESSION`` / ``TEMPLATE`` 判定）时的 ``Parsable.type`` "
"取值；``resolve()`` 直接返回 ``source`` 原样，不进入 两步渲染。"
msgstr ""
"The ``Parsable.type`` value when ``source`` is an ordinary literal (``\"hello\"``, ``123``, ``true`` etc., and does not hit the ``RAW`` / "
"``FILE_REF`` / ``EXPRESSION`` / ``TEMPLATE`` determinations); "
"``resolve()`` returns ``source`` as-is, without entering two-step rendering."

#: flowing.parsable.LITERAL:10 of
msgid "值为模块级常量，比较必须用 ``is`` 或与 ``Parsable.type`` 相等性比较， 不依赖具体字面值。"
msgstr "The value is a module-level constant; comparison must use ``is`` or equality against ``Parsable.type``, without relying on the concrete literal value."

#: flowing.parsable.LITERAL:12 of
msgid ""
"``.fya`` 解析层不会为非字符串 YAML 值构造 Parsable（例外：字段被宿主 声明为 Parsable 承载时，非字符串值也包装为"
" ``LITERAL``，见模块 docstring）；``LITERAL`` 的非字符串 ``source`` 其余只会出现在 Python "
"API 层手动构造的场景（如 ``Parsable(123)``）。"
msgstr ""
"The ``.fya`` parsing layer does not construct Parsable for non-string YAML values (exception: when a field is declared by its host as Parsable-carrying, "
"non-string values are also wrapped as ``LITERAL``; see the module docstring); otherwise, non-string ``source`` of ``LITERAL`` only appears in Python "
"API-layer manual construction scenarios (e.g. ``Parsable(123)``)."

#: flowing.parsable.LITERAL:16 of
msgid ""
"不做任何 Jinja2 解析：若字面量文本恰好含 ``{{ }}``，判定会先命中 ``TEMPLATE``；要保留原始文本须使用 "
"``$\"...\"`` （``RAW``）。"
msgstr ""
"No Jinja2 parsing at all: if the literal text happens to contain ``{{ }}``, determination hits ``TEMPLATE`` first; to preserve raw text you must use "
"``$\"...\"`` (``RAW``)."

#: flowing.parsable.LITERAL:19 of
msgid ":class:`Parsable`、:data:`RAW`、:data:`TEMPLATE`"
msgstr ":class:`Parsable`, :data:`RAW`, :data:`TEMPLATE`"

#: flowing.parsable.FILE_REF:1 of
msgid "``$`` 文件引用形式标记。"
msgstr "``$`` file-reference form marker."

#: flowing.parsable.FILE_REF:3 of
msgid ""
"``source`` 以 ``$`` 开头（且非 ``$\"...\"`` 形式）时的 ``Parsable.type`` 取值，如 "
"``$./system-prompt.md``、``$@/shared/base.md``；``resolve()`` "
"时现场读取被引用文件内容并进入第二步 Jinja2 渲染。"
msgstr ""
"The ``Parsable.type`` value when ``source`` starts with ``$`` (and is not the ``$\"...\"`` form), e.g. "
"``$./system-prompt.md``, ``$@/shared/base.md``; at ``resolve()`` "
"time the referenced file's content is read on the spot and enters the second Jinja2 rendering step."

#: flowing.parsable.FILE_REF:9 of
msgid "``$`` 展开只发生在 Parsable 顶层，不递归：被引用文件中的 ``$path`` 作为普通文本进入第二步。"
msgstr "``$`` expansion only happens at the Parsable top level, non-recursively: a ``$path`` inside the referenced file enters the second step as ordinary text."
